(3417137, 473336, 52439, '<td valign="top">I like it, love the tones and the whole concept, my only gripe is it''s a bit unbalanced with the skater in the middle, should be further left to balance the people in the background.</td>', 'I like it, love the tones and the whole concept, my only gripe is it''s a bit unbalanced with the skater in the middle, should be further left to balance the people in the background.', '2007-03-01 05:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417139, 477211, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the fisheye.<br/>Nice use of black and white.<br/>Just needs a bit more interest in the shot, especially to the right where it all kinda blends together.</td>', 'Nice use of the fisheye.Nice use of black and white.Just needs a bit more interest in the shot, especially to the right where it all kinda blends together.', '2007-03-01 05:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417140, 477213, 6999, '<td valign="top">The foreground rather lets this down I fear - seems to me just a featureless dull grey band across the image; A shame really, as this would be a fine landscape image - stars are always effective.</td>', 'The foreground rather lets this down I fear - seems to me just a featureless dull grey band across the image; A shame really, as this would be a fine landscape image - stars are always effective.', '2007-03-01 05:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417141, 465259, 52439, '<td valign="top">Haha, awesome.</td>', 'Haha, awesome.', '2007-03-01 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417143, 476441, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not my kind of thing at all - and even allowing for that, it seems to step across the line that divides the stylistic from the silly: I think she''s too close to his size for any impression of protection to be given, and the water seems entirely gratuitous.</td>', 'Not my kind of thing at all - and even allowing for that, it seems to step across the line that divides the stylistic from the silly: I think she''s too close to his size for any impression of protection to be given, and the water seems entirely gratuitous.', '2007-03-01 05:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417144, 465350, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.<br/>9 from me.</td>', 'Brilliant.9 from me.', '2007-03-01 05:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417145, 476795, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2007-03-01 05:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417147, 477419, 6999, '<td valign="top">A decent image, but I struggle to find more in it than a simple depiction. The rowers add some interest to the lower part of frame visually, but that high-tech kind of racing boat doesn''t make for any technological or environmental contrast with the cityscape, leaving the image perhaps too much of an ordinary moment for me.</td>', 'A decent image, but I struggle to find more in it than a simple depiction. The rowers add some interest to the lower part of frame visually, but that high-tech kind of racing boat doesn''t make for any technological or environmental contrast with the cityscape, leaving the image perhaps too much of an ordinary moment for me.', '2007-03-01 05:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417148, 477340, 6999, '<td valign="top">Solid child portrait. What else to say? It''s OK - technically fine. But that''s all.</td>', 'Solid child portrait. What else to say? It''s OK - technically fine. But that''s all.', '2007-03-01 05:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417154, 466808, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now I really think your border - I hate commenting on borders because usually they''re so much a matter of taste - I think it has a major impact on the viewing of this image. It makes it hard to concentrate on any detail of light and shade within the image, and this surely depends on that kind of detail for its effect. Those textures are already confused with the wall behind - not necessarily a bad thing, in fact even a positive, as far as being a different idea from so many images, but the big black block massively affects the eye in trying to see that detail.</td>', 'Now I really think your border - I hate commenting on borders because usually they''re so much a matter of taste - I think it has a major impact on the viewing of this image. It makes it hard to concentrate on any detail of light and shade within the image, and this surely depends on that kind of detail for its effect. Those textures are already confused with the wall behind - not necessarily a bad thing, in fact even a positive, as far as being a different idea from so many images, but the big black block massively affects the eye in trying to see that detail.', '2007-03-01 05:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417157, 476118, 6999, '<td valign="top">Details of the wheel are rather lost against the background of that cabin - too much similarity of light, and of tone. There''s no great sense of the three-dimensional here either - very flat light doesn''t help you.</td>', 'Details of the wheel are rather lost against the background of that cabin - too much similarity of light, and of tone. There''s no great sense of the three-dimensional here either - very flat light doesn''t help you.', '2007-03-01 05:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417160, 477427, 6999, '<td valign="top">The translucency of the petals is well caught, but i think your lighting overall will let this down - there just isn''t enough perceptible detail in the flowers. Difficult to light properly this, anyhow - but absolutely crucial to the effect that it should be.</td>', 'The translucency of the petals is well caught, but i think your lighting overall will let this down - there just isn''t enough perceptible detail in the flowers. Difficult to light properly this, anyhow - but absolutely crucial to the effect that it should be.', '2007-03-01 05:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417161, 474371, 70661, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2007-03-01 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417165, 462522, 6999, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t have great impact for me: I think perhaps that line of details - house and trees - is just too busy compared to the finely graduated near-blankness of the rest of the image.</td>', 'Doesn''t have great impact for me: I think perhaps that line of details - house and trees - is just too busy compared to the finely graduated near-blankness of the rest of the image.', '2007-03-01 05:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417168, 470434, 6999, '<td valign="top">The umber sky adds to the impact of this apparently out-of-place old bridge: nice contrast between the rural/bucolic bridge and the sodium glow of the city.</td>', 'The umber sky adds to the impact of this apparently out-of-place old bridge: nice contrast between the rural/bucolic bridge and the sodium glow of the city.', '2007-03-01 05:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417174, 470650, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting - and arresting - juxtaposition, and the clouds look more like smoke than anything. Foreground tonality is strange, and perhaps the landscape purists would have you clone out the telegraph poles. I guess some sill tell you its underexposed, but I think your choice is quite carefully made, and quite effective. Dealing with whites like this is a tricky decision.</td>', 'Interesting - and arresting - juxtaposition, and the clouds look more like smoke than anything. Foreground tonality is strange, and perhaps the landscape purists would have you clone out the telegraph poles. I guess some sill tell you its underexposed, but I think your choice is quite carefully made, and quite effective. Dealing with whites like this is a tricky decision.', '2007-03-01 05:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417176, 465259, 70661, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what kind of animal this is but it''s very cute. I like this shot.</td>', 'I don''t know what kind of animal this is but it''s very cute. I like this shot.', '2007-03-01 05:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417178, 477179, 48228, '<td valign="top">Just perfect in everyway.....<br/>Awesome and love the textures and colors of the feathers..... <br/>Definately a "10" from me.....</td>', 'Just perfect in everyway.....Awesome and love the textures and colors of the feathers..... Definately a "10" from me.....', '2007-03-01 05:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417183, 473336, 73230, '<td valign="top">As a an old skateboarder myself i can relate to this shot. Brings back alot of happy memories.</td>', 'As a an old skateboarder myself i can relate to this shot. Brings back alot of happy memories.', '2007-03-01 05:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417184, 473886, 22637, '<td valign="top">Greate capture!</td>', 'Greate capture!', '2007-03-01 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417185, 470716, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very difficult, technically - those colours and motion against the black of the hide. Don''t think you''ve quite pulled it off - simple compositionally the framing is a bit awkward, and there just isn''t enough ''horse'' about the image. Right hand of frame adds little, and makes the framing of the rest - well, uncomfortable.</td>', 'Very difficult, technically - those colours and motion against the black of the hide. Don''t think you''ve quite pulled it off - simple compositionally the framing is a bit awkward, and there just isn''t enough ''horse'' about the image. Right hand of frame adds little, and makes the framing of the rest - well, uncomfortable.', '2007-03-01 05:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417191, 477483, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice one here.....</td>', 'Nice one here.....', '2007-03-01 06:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417192, 477318, 6999, '<td valign="top">Confusing, I think, compositionally. A difficult exposure anyhow, for sure, but some more play with the levels of the majority of the image might have helped - you seem to have relegated most of the interest in the image - the detail of pattern and light in the snow and rocks, to a very narrow dynamic range - perhaps simply to maintain control of the lightness in the sky, which has anyway drifted out of control at the very brightest point.</td>', 'Confusing, I think, compositionally. A difficult exposure anyhow, for sure, but some more play with the levels of the majority of the image might have helped - you seem to have relegated most of the interest in the image - the detail of pattern and light in the snow and rocks, to a very narrow dynamic range - perhaps simply to maintain control of the lightness in the sky, which has anyway drifted out of control at the very brightest point.', '2007-03-01 06:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417197, 474251, 6999, '<td valign="top">The light seems good, but in the interesting part of frame - where the focus is, on the right-hand side, that curve of the bigger petals, your shadows are very washed out, which makes a sense of real detail impossible to see, and makes the entire thing seem washed out.</td>', 'The light seems good, but in the interesting part of frame - where the focus is, on the right-hand side, that curve of the bigger petals, your shadows are very washed out, which makes a sense of real detail impossible to see, and makes the entire thing seem washed out.', '2007-03-01 06:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417198, 476658, 52572, '<td valign="top">hahahha<br/>looks like the sea lion looking at human<br/>I love this pic. It makes me smiling! :D</td>', 'hahahhalooks like the sea lion looking at humanI love this pic. It makes me smiling! :D', '2007-03-01 06:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417204, 476952, 6999, '<td valign="top">An interestingly old-fashioned feel to this. For me the light is simply too flat, the entire thing lacking in a feel of contrast, and making it difficult to engage with. I appreciate that you have strong black and white points to deal with, but I think the tonal range of the greys of the image are too centred around on - quite dark - level, and some careful adjustment of that range would work wonders for it.</td>', 'An interestingly old-fashioned feel to this. For me the light is simply too flat, the entire thing lacking in a feel of contrast, and making it difficult to engage with. I appreciate that you have strong black and white points to deal with, but I think the tonal range of the greys of the image are too centred around on - quite dark - level, and some careful adjustment of that range would work wonders for it.', '2007-03-01 06:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417207, 477198, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good detail, and finally some decent light in an image. Good tonality too.</td>', 'Good detail, and finally some decent light in an image. Good tonality too.', '2007-03-01 06:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417216, 462354, 35044, '<td valign="top">whiterook?</td>', 'whiterook?', '2007-03-01 06:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417220, 471958, 35044, '<td valign="top">The fact that it is shot at iso 3200 makes very little impact on the image: it lacks sharpness, detail, and is noisy. I like the colour treatment though.</td>', 'The fact that it is shot at iso 3200 makes very little impact on the image: it lacks sharpness, detail, and is noisy. I like the colour treatment though.', '2007-03-01 06:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417221, 477204, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t find any real interest in this image. Simply visually, its a confusing and not everso well composed picture. The slight motion-blur of the background somehow isn''t enough to impart a sense of much motion to the tram - perhaps because of the inevitable blurs and streaks one would expect from a near-night-time urban shot. I also don''t see anything in the figures in the tram, nor relation to the outside of it. I''d be interested to know what you see in it yourself - I just have the feeling I might be missing something here.</td>', 'I don''t find any real interest in this image. Simply visually, its a confusing and not everso well composed picture. The slight motion-blur of the background somehow isn''t enough to impart a sense of much motion to the tram - perhaps because of the inevitable blurs and streaks one would expect from a near-night-time urban shot. I also don''t see anything in the figures in the tram, nor relation to the outside of it. I''d be interested to know what you see in it yourself - I just have the feeling I might be missing something here.', '2007-03-01 06:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417228, 471684, 6999, '<td valign="top">A reasonably ordinary scene like this requires some special moment of light or situation to make it stand out as worth presenting I think; this just doesn''t quite have it. The house, trees and other boats confuse a potentially simple composition, the light seems quite flat, making the shapes of the boats - those curves should be a gift - difficult to distinguish. The confusion of the masts/outriggers/whatever-they''re-called could be an advantage in a simpler situation, here they just continue the complication of the treee silhouettes behind them.</td>', 'A reasonably ordinary scene like this requires some special moment of light or situation to make it stand out as worth presenting I think; this just doesn''t quite have it. The house, trees and other boats confuse a potentially simple composition, the light seems quite flat, making the shapes of the boats - those curves should be a gift - difficult to distinguish. The confusion of the masts/outriggers/whatever-they''re-called could be an advantage in a simpler situation, here they just continue the complication of the treee silhouettes behind them.', '2007-03-01 06:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417237, 473952, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fine way to start the day, presuming there''s coffee in that mug. There''s a sense of desperation about this, given the title - both as an honest self-assessment and as an entry, which makes it interesting despite its lack of photographic quality. <br/> <br/>You''ve taken enough care of the background to suggest more than a simple snapshot here - and yet, with all that care you''ve paid almost no attention to the light. I would urge you to take a good look at some other still lifes, some of the higher rated ones here would do, and see how they''re lit - look at the reflections of the light sources in shiny objects, and of the graduations of shadow across objects, and look at the simplicity of the composition - as few elements as can put the message across usually. Because that''s what this image lacks. The light is flat - it''s shadows that let us know the shapes of things, and if someone told me that aspirin bottle was a cardboard cut-out I''d almost believe them. You could lose the other pill bottle, the top of the aspirin bottle, the three pills and it wouldn''t change a thing about the impact of this image - in fact, it would make it simpler, easier to view. More successful.</td>', 'Fine way to start the day, presuming there''s coffee in that mug. There''s a sense of desperation about this, given the title - both as an honest self-assessment and as an entry, which makes it interesting despite its lack of photographic quality.  You''ve taken enough care of the background to suggest more than a simple snapshot here - and yet, with all that care you''ve paid almost no attention to the light. I would urge you to take a good look at some other still lifes, some of the higher rated ones here would do, and see how they''re lit - look at the reflections of the light sources in shiny objects, and of the graduations of shadow across objects, and look at the simplicity of the composition - as few elements as can put the message across usually. Because that''s what this image lacks. The light is flat - it''s shadows that let us know the shapes of things, and if someone told me that aspirin bottle was a cardboard cut-out I''d almost believe them. You could lose the other pill bottle, the top of the aspirin bottle, the three pills and it wouldn''t change a thing about the impact of this image - in fact, it would make it simpler, easier to view. More successful.', '2007-03-01 06:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417239, 476427, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strong detail and tones, eye-catching composition - although if i were getting arty I''d moan about the tree-tops. Would a higher contrast processing not have worked better? made more of the organic nature of the smoke versus the clean technical lines of the ladder?</td>', 'Strong detail and tones, eye-catching composition - although if i were getting arty I''d moan about the tree-tops. Would a higher contrast processing not have worked better? made more of the organic nature of the smoke versus the clean technical lines of the ladder?', '2007-03-01 06:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417240, 477374, 61348, '<td valign="top">Ohhh <br/>perfect</td>', 'Ohhh perfect', '2007-03-01 06:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417242, 471226, 61348, '<td valign="top">I like verry much the post processing <br/>Is is the draganizer?</td>', 'I like verry much the post processing Is is the draganizer?', '2007-03-01 06:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417243, 477085, 61348, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2007-03-01 06:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417244, 469763, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m starting to wonder whether the gamma settings on my monitor have slipped, or something. The midtones here seem quite compressed, I''d love to see a greater sense of the fine detail that expanding them a little might bring to this.</td>', 'I''m starting to wonder whether the gamma settings on my monitor have slipped, or something. The midtones here seem quite compressed, I''d love to see a greater sense of the fine detail that expanding them a little might bring to this.', '2007-03-01 06:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417245, 469377, 61348, '<td valign="top">Like veru muich the diagonal and the colours <br/>good luck</td>', 'Like veru muich the diagonal and the colours good luck', '2007-03-01 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417246, 477492, 6999, '<td valign="top">Too much going on for a really eye-catching still life? The star-fruit looks unappetising, and just doesn''t have the shininess you''ve managed to give to the other fruits.</td>', 'Too much going on for a really eye-catching still life? The star-fruit looks unappetising, and just doesn''t have the shininess you''ve managed to give to the other fruits.', '2007-03-01 06:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417247, 472176, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well captured, but not an outstanding moment, nor so very unusual a viewpoint that it brings anything interesting to this sunset. Good progression of colours in the clouds etc., but just isn''t different enough to be striking for me.</td>', 'Well captured, but not an outstanding moment, nor so very unusual a viewpoint that it brings anything interesting to this sunset. Good progression of colours in the clouds etc., but just isn''t different enough to be striking for me.', '2007-03-01 06:33:48.000000', NULL, 1);
