(3417258, 477122, 55838, '<td valign="top">So how many comments have you receieved so far about the string?  Oo Oo can I guess?...let''s see about 20 votes so far so 20 x 1 = about 20 eh?  : ) Am I right?  Hee hee!  Voters seem to love to pounce on stuff like that as if it''s something you are unaware of at this point!  Lovely shot and a nice idea.  Very pretty colors.  I think my eyes might prefer about 1.5 inches of the negative space cropped off the left and a less chunky border but a nice flow to the shape of the tulips.  7</td>', 'So how many comments have you receieved so far about the string?  Oo Oo can I guess?...let''s see about 20 votes so far so 20 x 1 = about 20 eh?  : ) Am I right?  Hee hee!  Voters seem to love to pounce on stuff like that as if it''s something you are unaware of at this point!  Lovely shot and a nice idea.  Very pretty colors.  I think my eyes might prefer about 1.5 inches of the negative space cropped off the left and a less chunky border but a nice flow to the shape of the tulips.  7', '2007-03-01 06:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
