(3417534, 475920, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range.  The hint of softness works well without losing the detail of the grasses.    I like how the walkway curves off to the left. Gorgeous sky too. 7</td>', 'Nice tonal range.  The hint of softness works well without losing the detail of the grasses.    I like how the walkway curves off to the left. Gorgeous sky too. 7', '2007-03-01 08:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417536, 476541, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice ad type shot but not very exciting for a free study. I think I''d like to see all of the reflection and not have part of it chopped off at the bottom.  The lighting and focus are good.</td>', 'Nice ad type shot but not very exciting for a free study. I think I''d like to see all of the reflection and not have part of it chopped off at the bottom.  The lighting and focus are good.', '2007-03-01 08:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417541, 477427, 15711, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but the petals of the lilies lack the detail they need to really give them oomph.  Maybe the lighting, maybe the lens.  I have the exact same problem when I take images of white flowers.  I like the black background.  I think I would have prefered more neg. space to one side as well.</td>', 'Pretty, but the petals of the lilies lack the detail they need to really give them oomph.  Maybe the lighting, maybe the lens.  I have the exact same problem when I take images of white flowers.  I like the black background.  I think I would have prefered more neg. space to one side as well.', '2007-03-01 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417543, 476621, 15711, '<td valign="top">Simple and very pretty.  I like the lines coming away from the flowers.  Beautiful bokeh.  I think if it were my shot, I''d get down so that I''m not looking down, but across the field, if that makes sense.  Nothing like getting your belly all wet for a shot. ;~D 6</td>', 'Simple and very pretty.  I like the lines coming away from the flowers.  Beautiful bokeh.  I think if it were my shot, I''d get down so that I''m not looking down, but across the field, if that makes sense.  Nothing like getting your belly all wet for a shot. ;~D 6', '2007-03-01 08:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417547, 477176, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light.  I like how the shadow creeps up the apple.  Not overly exciting, but well done and well done in its simplicity. 6</td>', 'Nice soft light.  I like how the shadow creeps up the apple.  Not overly exciting, but well done and well done in its simplicity. 6', '2007-03-01 08:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417550, 476607, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  I like that we can see the whiskers.  I might''ve removed the wicker chair, or possibly cropped out part of it and zoomed in a bit more on the kitty.  What a glorious creature.  Great DOF!! 7</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  I like that we can see the whiskers.  I might''ve removed the wicker chair, or possibly cropped out part of it and zoomed in a bit more on the kitty.  What a glorious creature.  Great DOF!! 7', '2007-03-01 08:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417554, 477131, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  Makes me think of a travel magazine. Nice colors and the side focus is good. Not the most exciting photo I''ver ever seen, but for what it is, well done.</td>', 'Great detail.  Makes me think of a travel magazine. Nice colors and the side focus is good. Not the most exciting photo I''ver ever seen, but for what it is, well done.', '2007-03-01 08:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417557, 476160, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the detail of the poppy''s petals.  Not expected, with that vivid yellow background. Lovely, although I''m not wild about the background color for some reason.  I get the complementary thing, but it just seems too ... um... something. I''ll revisit after more coffee. ;~D</td>', 'I like the detail of the poppy''s petals.  Not expected, with that vivid yellow background. Lovely, although I''m not wild about the background color for some reason.  I get the complementary thing, but it just seems too ... um... something. I''ll revisit after more coffee. ;~D', '2007-03-01 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417560, 477199, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape. The sky''s swirls almost mimic the curve of the water beneath. The balance of light, shadow and mid tones is great.</td>', 'Very nice landscape. The sky''s swirls almost mimic the curve of the water beneath. The balance of light, shadow and mid tones is great.', '2007-03-01 08:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417565, 477348, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous. I love the wide angle in combination with the duotone.  Great variation of highlights, shadow and midtones.  Gorgeous. I''d love to see it HUGE, so we could appreciate more of the detail.  Just spectacular.  My fav so far.  The composition is flawless.  Congrats on a job well done.</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous. I love the wide angle in combination with the duotone.  Great variation of highlights, shadow and midtones.  Gorgeous. I''d love to see it HUGE, so we could appreciate more of the detail.  Just spectacular.  My fav so far.  The composition is flawless.  Congrats on a job well done.', '2007-03-01 09:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417568, 476727, 15711, '<td valign="top">Unexpected and well done.  For some reason though, the gords seem out of whack, if that makes sense.  Maybe it''s the angle of the shot.  The lighting is beautiful and I love the bowl of fruit. 6</td>', 'Unexpected and well done.  For some reason though, the gords seem out of whack, if that makes sense.  Maybe it''s the angle of the shot.  The lighting is beautiful and I love the bowl of fruit. 6', '2007-03-01 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
