(3417574, 475600, 66635, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like it a lot.  My one criticism is that the sky seems too blue and doesn''t look real to me.</td>', 'Overall, I like it a lot.  My one criticism is that the sky seems too blue and doesn''t look real to me.', '2007-03-01 09:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417578, 475781, 15711, '<td valign="top">She''s lovely.  I think she''s way too close to the wicker/woven background.  Seems a touch overdone with either softness or maybe neat image.  I love her smile and eyes. Great hair. I''d prefer she not be so dead centered. Maybe more neg. space to one side.</td>', 'She''s lovely.  I think she''s way too close to the wicker/woven background.  Seems a touch overdone with either softness or maybe neat image.  I love her smile and eyes. Great hair. I''d prefer she not be so dead centered. Maybe more neg. space to one side.', '2007-03-01 09:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417582, 467973, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like a postcard.  NOt at all a fan of the fuschia border.  I think it pulls your eye OUT instead of back to the building.  Nice lighting and focus for a night shot.</td>', 'Looks like a postcard.  NOt at all a fan of the fuschia border.  I think it pulls your eye OUT instead of back to the building.  Nice lighting and focus for a night shot.', '2007-03-01 09:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
