(3417688, 472087, 15711, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS.  Like you took a painters box of colors and hand did all of those layers.  Wonderful detail.  Great landscape shot.  The sky''s cool blue in combination with the rich warm tones of the land - SPOT ON.</td>', 'GORGEOUS.  Like you took a painters box of colors and hand did all of those layers.  Wonderful detail.  Great landscape shot.  The sky''s cool blue in combination with the rich warm tones of the land - SPOT ON.', '2007-03-01 09:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417689, 469365, 35545, '<td valign="top">Straighten out that horizon.</td>', 'Straighten out that horizon.', '2007-03-01 09:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417693, 477470, 54228, '<td valign="top">A little flat, and the halo around the building distracts significantly in my opinion. I''d also like a little more saturation in the building and grass.</td>', 'A little flat, and the halo around the building distracts significantly in my opinion. I''d also like a little more saturation in the building and grass.', '2007-03-01 09:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417696, 476116, 15711, '<td valign="top">Heh, dude, I know you!!!! Nice lighting and focus.  My only nitpick is the button on your cuff - kind of pulls your eye down away from your face.  Excellent tonal range.</td>', 'Heh, dude, I know you!!!! Nice lighting and focus.  My only nitpick is the button on your cuff - kind of pulls your eye down away from your face.  Excellent tonal range.', '2007-03-01 09:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417697, 476745, 69102, '<td valign="top">too much border. nice textures, but if the picture itself had been bigger it would be easier to evaluate - 5</td>', 'too much border. nice textures, but if the picture itself had been bigger it would be easier to evaluate - 5', '2007-03-01 09:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417699, 474783, 15711, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  It is hard to capture white blooms and you did it splendidly. I like how the stem and leaves are almost lost in the dark shadow of the background.  Beautiful work here.  I really like the square crop as well. BRAVO</td>', 'Gorgeous.  It is hard to capture white blooms and you did it splendidly. I like how the stem and leaves are almost lost in the dark shadow of the background.  Beautiful work here.  I really like the square crop as well. BRAVO', '2007-03-01 09:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417700, 469826, 54228, '<td valign="top">Struggling to find a place for my eyes to rest, but otherwise you have great sharpness and beautiful colours. 6</td>', 'Struggling to find a place for my eyes to rest, but otherwise you have great sharpness and beautiful colours. 6', '2007-03-01 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417701, 477116, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such pretty bokeh.  Nice colors and the focus is good. His eye and beak seem a smidge oversharp.  Maybe it''s just me.</td>', 'Such pretty bokeh.  Nice colors and the focus is good. His eye and beak seem a smidge oversharp.  Maybe it''s just me.', '2007-03-01 09:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3417702, 469376, 15711, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha  Great title.</td>', 'ha ha ha  Great title.', '2007-03-01 09:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
