(3417709, 464342, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow - if only there were a deer with antlers. ;~D I love the emotive feeling you get looking at this.  Very basic - like back to our beginnings.</td>', 'Wow - if only there were a deer with antlers. ;~D I love the emotive feeling you get looking at this.  Very basic - like back to our beginnings.', '2007-03-01 09:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
