(3418403, 477435, 60614, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Nice crisp photo.  This may be too dark for some but I seem to love the darker images.  Seems very peaceful.  The first thing I noticed was the face in tree to the right top looking back at Jesus on the cross.  I then looked closer and noticed other faces.  To the bottom left it looks like the trunk has big eyes and its mouth is open.  Seems to be speaking to the back of cross.  The trunk to the farthest bottom left seems to have its eyes closed but mouth open.  This seems to add a lot of character.  I hope more voters will take time to really look at your photo to see all the wonderful characteristics.  I really love the warm green and brown colors.</td>', 'WOW.  Nice crisp photo.  This may be too dark for some but I seem to love the darker images.  Seems very peaceful.  The first thing I noticed was the face in tree to the right top looking back at Jesus on the cross.  I then looked closer and noticed other faces.  To the bottom left it looks like the trunk has big eyes and its mouth is open.  Seems to be speaking to the back of cross.  The trunk to the farthest bottom left seems to have its eyes closed but mouth open.  This seems to add a lot of character.  I hope more voters will take time to really look at your photo to see all the wonderful characteristics.  I really love the warm green and brown colors.', '2007-03-01 12:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
