(3419199, 477482, 6999, '<td valign="top">The large border and small inner image suggests a sense of ''art'' be considered in this image - like a gallery presentation; but I don''t get it. I don''t see anything I haven''t shot and rejected a thousand times myself. It has a certain mood, I suppose. A feeling of late winter, perhaps. I''m struggling to find anything to say about it.</td>', 'The large border and small inner image suggests a sense of ''art'' be considered in this image - like a gallery presentation; but I don''t get it. I don''t see anything I haven''t shot and rejected a thousand times myself. It has a certain mood, I suppose. A feeling of late winter, perhaps. I''m struggling to find anything to say about it.', '2007-03-01 15:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
