(3421268, 477486, 57378, '<td valign="top">Lovel tones. Nice change of composition which is good.</td>', 'Lovel tones. Nice change of composition which is good.', '2007-03-01 23:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421269, 477300, 41337, '<td valign="top">Two had enough but one still finds a reason to stay. Great capture.</td>', 'Two had enough but one still finds a reason to stay. Great capture.', '2007-03-01 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421270, 477120, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice framing - Shame about the blown out highlights.</td>', 'Nice framing - Shame about the blown out highlights.', '2007-03-01 23:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421271, 476529, 57378, '<td valign="top">Love the tree</td>', 'Love the tree', '2007-03-01 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421275, 474066, 45519, '<td valign="top">Post processing the background (red rocks) to achieve more blur helps bring out the subject, if at the expense of looking processed versus true DOF.  But with the foreground tree in the composition, this takes on an almost dioramic effect ... which actually works if interpreted in that way.</td>', 'Post processing the background (red rocks) to achieve more blur helps bring out the subject, if at the expense of looking processed versus true DOF.  But with the foreground tree in the composition, this takes on an almost dioramic effect ... which actually works if interpreted in that way.', '2007-03-01 23:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421277, 477210, 57378, '<td valign="top">Looks very cold - Well done for getting out there.</td>', 'Looks very cold - Well done for getting out there.', '2007-03-01 23:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421278, 466418, 69102, '<td valign="top">not sure that this will go over well on DPC, but I really love this shot. has a dreamy, nostalgiac quality.</td>', 'not sure that this will go over well on DPC, but I really love this shot. has a dreamy, nostalgiac quality.', '2007-03-01 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421280, 477225, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great crispness - Lovely study.</td>', 'Great crispness - Lovely study.', '2007-03-01 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421283, 477377, 70000, '<td valign="top">great job on capturing the light on hr face eve though the sun is behind her, This is beautiful :)</td>', 'great job on capturing the light on hr face eve though the sun is behind her, This is beautiful :)', '2007-03-01 23:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421286, 463405, 69102, '<td valign="top">the pp on this makes it look like an oil painting. not a bad effect, just kind of brings you up short. very different looking, but in a good way.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-08 00:06:57.</i></td>', 'the pp on this makes it look like an oil painting. not a bad effect, just kind of brings you up short. very different looking, but in a good way.', '2007-03-01 23:50:45.000000', '2007-03-08 00:06:57.000000', 1),
(3421287, 476963, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice muted tones and focus</td>', 'Nice muted tones and focus', '2007-03-01 23:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421288, 477388, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2007-03-01 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421290, 470659, 70000, '<td valign="top">the big shaddow at the top left really takes away from a really awesome photo, maybe a different crop? the lighting here is really cool</td>', 'the big shaddow at the top left really takes away from a really awesome photo, maybe a different crop? the lighting here is really cool', '2007-03-01 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421291, 476156, 69102, '<td valign="top">with both the horse and the rider facing away, it doesn''t seem that there is very much energy in this shot. the light is nice, however.</td>', 'with both the horse and the rider facing away, it doesn''t seem that there is very much energy in this shot. the light is nice, however.', '2007-03-01 23:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421293, 477203, 70000, '<td valign="top">adorable!!! even with the contrast funky and the coloring off, you have caught a great moment, the composition and motion really work</td>', 'adorable!!! even with the contrast funky and the coloring off, you have caught a great moment, the composition and motion really work', '2007-03-01 23:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421296, 468392, 69102, '<td valign="top">lovely textures and lighting. the shallow dof is interesting here, but I''m not sure that it really adds much to the shot in the end, because what is really interesting is the details on the surface of the leaf.</td>', 'lovely textures and lighting. the shallow dof is interesting here, but I''m not sure that it really adds much to the shot in the end, because what is really interesting is the details on the surface of the leaf.', '2007-03-01 23:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421298, 477390, 69102, '<td valign="top">the expression makes you look like you''ve startled him. ;)</td>', 'the expression makes you look like you''ve startled him. ;)', '2007-03-01 23:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421299, 466596, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good composition and overall the subject has potential. The flat lighting is really hurting this. It subdues the textures and overexposes the handle. Changing the angle of the light or waiting for that angle to change if sun light would have helped your shot immensely, IMO.</td>', 'Good composition and overall the subject has potential. The flat lighting is really hurting this. It subdues the textures and overexposes the handle. Changing the angle of the light or waiting for that angle to change if sun light would have helped your shot immensely, IMO.', '2007-03-01 23:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421301, 474176, 69102, '<td valign="top">not much really going on here, but it''s hard to tell because the picture is sized a bit small.</td>', 'not much really going on here, but it''s hard to tell because the picture is sized a bit small.', '2007-03-01 23:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421302, 466808, 70000, '<td valign="top">the border doesnt seem to add to the picture, its a bit destracting</td>', 'the border doesnt seem to add to the picture, its a bit destracting', '2007-03-01 23:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421304, 477462, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Just lacking a real black which makes it look a little flat</td>', 'Nice capture - Just lacking a real black which makes it look a little flat', '2007-03-01 23:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421305, 477489, 70000, '<td valign="top">I love this, I would have prefered you leaving in more of the ripples in the water so that they fade into nothing instead of stopping short in a line, but the composition is beautiful and gives off so much feeling</td>', 'I love this, I would have prefered you leaving in more of the ripples in the water so that they fade into nothing instead of stopping short in a line, but the composition is beautiful and gives off so much feeling', '2007-03-01 23:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421308, 477211, 70000, '<td valign="top">Cool lense work, I like the composition of this picture, the title is cool too</td>', 'Cool lense work, I like the composition of this picture, the title is cool too', '2007-03-01 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421310, 473355, 70000, '<td valign="top">... no thanks....<br/> <br/>haha anyways, I really like the uglyness of the air contrasting with the title. It really makes a statement. Great job</td>', '... no thanks.... haha anyways, I really like the uglyness of the air contrasting with the title. It really makes a statement. Great job', '2007-03-01 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3421311, 476394, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Very simple and pleasing.</td>', 'Nice capture - Very simple and pleasing.', '2007-03-01 23:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421312, 476118, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2007-03-01 23:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421313, 470713, 45519, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model/subject in a nicely composed and captured scene.  For the most part, all of the post processing effects add to the image ... save for those to the model''s skin; she looks plastic.</td>', 'Beautiful model/subject in a nicely composed and captured scene.  For the most part, all of the post processing effects add to the image ... save for those to the model''s skin; she looks plastic.', '2007-03-01 23:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421314, 477189, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Missing the UK!</td>', 'Nice capture - Missing the UK!', '2007-03-01 23:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421317, 477474, 57378, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and great exposure.</td>', 'Lovely tones and great exposure.', '2007-03-01 23:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421319, 476282, 70000, '<td valign="top">The balance you have going on here is really cool, the flatness of the top of the tree is really odd looking and works with the overall composition. I like this landscape alot.</td>', 'The balance you have going on here is really cool, the flatness of the top of the tree is really odd looking and works with the overall composition. I like this landscape alot.', '2007-03-01 23:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421320, 476621, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.</td>', 'Great lighting.', '2007-03-01 23:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421327, 476427, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good technical quality. I''m not sure I like the angle you took with this capture though. I don''t get a sense of scale that your title is hinting at. Maybe a lower angle or wider one would have worked better.</td>', 'Good technical quality. I''m not sure I like the angle you took with this capture though. I don''t get a sense of scale that your title is hinting at. Maybe a lower angle or wider one would have worked better.', '2007-03-02 00:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421363, 477149, 41337, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this shot. The scattering of light captures the night perfectly. I think what would add even more intrigue is if someone or something was on the right hidden in shadow waiting for when your eyes arrived and hitting you with one last impression of the scene before your eyes exit the frame.</td>', 'Overall, I like this shot. The scattering of light captures the night perfectly. I think what would add even more intrigue is if someone or something was on the right hidden in shadow waiting for when your eyes arrived and hitting you with one last impression of the scene before your eyes exit the frame.', '2007-03-02 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421365, 474800, 45519, '<td valign="top">I thought it was Fixed or Repaired Daily? ;-)  Nice capture ... love the falling snow.</td>', 'I thought it was Fixed or Repaired Daily? ;-)  Nice capture ... love the falling snow.', '2007-03-02 00:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421366, 476330, 41337, '<td valign="top">Such a fitting title!</td>', 'Such a fitting title!', '2007-03-02 00:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421373, 477427, 41337, '<td valign="top">That one petal that is twisted on the left breaks up the purity of the subject somewhat. I might have been tempted to just clone that out right at the twist part.</td>', 'That one petal that is twisted on the left breaks up the purity of the subject somewhat. I might have been tempted to just clone that out right at the twist part.', '2007-03-02 00:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421375, 477106, 45519, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2007-03-02 00:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421379, 464741, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good lighting but I think you could have used a wider tonal range to show a little more between the flower and the leaves.</td>', 'Good lighting but I think you could have used a wider tonal range to show a little more between the flower and the leaves.', '2007-03-02 00:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421390, 477010, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good color and sharpness. The lighting however isn''t your friend here. It''s much too direct providing little shadow play. A shot taken closer to sunset or sunrise would yield better results.</td>', 'Good color and sharpness. The lighting however isn''t your friend here. It''s much too direct providing little shadow play. A shot taken closer to sunset or sunrise would yield better results.', '2007-03-02 00:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421403, 477494, 41357, '<td valign="top">nice 8</td>', 'nice 8', '2007-03-02 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421405, 477118, 41357, '<td valign="top">nice angle 8</td>', 'nice angle 8', '2007-03-02 00:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421408, 474031, 41357, '<td valign="top">nice 8</td>', 'nice 8', '2007-03-02 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421410, 476889, 41337, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting capture but I really don''t like how you edited it if I am to be honest. The selective desaturation really has no purpose and doesn''t add anything artistically in my opinion and the slight "popping out of the frame" that''s going on with the tiger''s paw and the rope seems way too subtle to have much of an impact. That comes across more as a mistake than an intented result. I think going straight b/w here would have been your ticket.</td>', 'This is an interesting capture but I really don''t like how you edited it if I am to be honest. The selective desaturation really has no purpose and doesn''t add anything artistically in my opinion and the slight "popping out of the frame" that''s going on with the tiger''s paw and the rope seems way too subtle to have much of an impact. That comes across more as a mistake than an intented result. I think going straight b/w here would have been your ticket.', '2007-03-02 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421411, 474282, 41357, '<td valign="top">nice 8</td>', 'nice 8', '2007-03-02 00:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3421419, 474552, 41337, '<td valign="top">Well shot. I probably would have soften the vignette some more on the right so that it was smoother like it is on the left but that''s about all the nitpicking I can do on this one. Overall a very professional looking image.</td>', 'Well shot. I probably would have soften the vignette some more on the right so that it was smoother like it is on the left but that''s about all the nitpicking I can do on this one. Overall a very professional looking image.', '2007-03-02 00:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
