(3423859, 475334, 66952, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...nice lighting and silhouette. The composition is interesting, but maybe too heavy on the right side. Maybe a bit oversharpened, I can see some halos around the girl, and at the horizon line. I can also see some banding in the sky. Overall, it''s a lovely shot, that would probably score better without the processing artifacts.</td>', 'Hmmm...nice lighting and silhouette. The composition is interesting, but maybe too heavy on the right side. Maybe a bit oversharpened, I can see some halos around the girl, and at the horizon line. I can also see some banding in the sky. Overall, it''s a lovely shot, that would probably score better without the processing artifacts.', '2007-03-02 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
