(3425926, 477019, 2022, '<td valign="top">I quite like this picture. However, I have two critisms. One is too much negative space on the right. I would prefer if the man with the horse were walking into the picture, rather than away, a tighter crop on the right would improve it, I think. Second critism is about the frame which I find quite distracting. Still I like the picture quite a bit (7)</td>', 'I quite like this picture. However, I have two critisms. One is too much negative space on the right. I would prefer if the man with the horse were walking into the picture, rather than away, a tighter crop on the right would improve it, I think. Second critism is about the frame which I find quite distracting. Still I like the picture quite a bit (7)', '2007-03-03 16:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
