(3425967, 477136, 2022, '<td valign="top">There is a certain disconnect here between the picture and the title. I see snow covered trees, quite possibly in the morning hours. However, there is no connection between what I see in the picture and Moscow. It could just as well have been taken in New York or in the middle of nowhere. Nor is the knowlegde that these particular trees are to be found in Moscow adding anything to the way I perceive this picture. (6)</td>', 'There is a certain disconnect here between the picture and the title. I see snow covered trees, quite possibly in the morning hours. However, there is no connection between what I see in the picture and Moscow. It could just as well have been taken in New York or in the middle of nowhere. Nor is the knowlegde that these particular trees are to be found in Moscow adding anything to the way I perceive this picture. (6)', '2007-03-03 16:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
