(3427363, 464741, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but am finding myself disconcerted because I can''t see the stem holding up the flowerhead.  I see it under the leaf, but then it disappears into blackness and then there''s a flowerhead, improbably resting on a petal.</td>', 'I like the idea, but am finding myself disconcerted because I can''t see the stem holding up the flowerhead.  I see it under the leaf, but then it disappears into blackness and then there''s a flowerhead, improbably resting on a petal.', '2007-03-04 08:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
