(3427390, 469081, 65234, '<td valign="top">I think the positioning of the tree in the frame looks good, but I can''t quite tell about the lighting on the icy branches, which I would love to see.  I would suggest cloning out the fire hydrant(?) on the lower right as it is distracting.</td>', 'I think the positioning of the tree in the frame looks good, but I can''t quite tell about the lighting on the icy branches, which I would love to see.  I would suggest cloning out the fire hydrant(?) on the lower right as it is distracting.', '2007-03-04 09:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3427391, 477112, 69246, '<td valign="top">I hope you are getting good scores on this. Its simple and captured the tones of the sun and snow very well.</td>', 'I hope you are getting good scores on this. Its simple and captured the tones of the sun and snow very well.', '2007-03-04 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3427400, 475421, 65234, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W looks like a good choice for this with various fabrics in view, and focus is great.  The thing that really grabs my attention here, though, is the painting on the wall.  I''d take it down for a portrait session.  Also, a straight-on perspective isn''t usually flattering to the subjects, IMO.  The one who looks the most interesting is the littlest girl whose shoulder is slightly angled to the camera.</td>', 'B&W looks like a good choice for this with various fabrics in view, and focus is great.  The thing that really grabs my attention here, though, is the painting on the wall.  I''d take it down for a portrait session.  Also, a straight-on perspective isn''t usually flattering to the subjects, IMO.  The one who looks the most interesting is the littlest girl whose shoulder is slightly angled to the camera.', '2007-03-04 09:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3427402, 474337, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great tree; I would like to see it a starker black in silhouette.</td>', 'Great tree; I would like to see it a starker black in silhouette.', '2007-03-04 09:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3427406, 474723, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  The glass isn''t nearly as interesting as the patterns the ink is making.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  The glass isn''t nearly as interesting as the patterns the ink is making.', '2007-03-04 09:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3427425, 477454, 65234, '<td valign="top">I had one of those at my birdfeeder yesterday!  Nice detail and good catch with the light in the eye.</td>', 'I had one of those at my birdfeeder yesterday!  Nice detail and good catch with the light in the eye.', '2007-03-04 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
