(3427926, 477155, 30982, '<td valign="top">This picture begs a story to be told with it.  A shallower depth of field would have isolated your subject from the background a little better.</td>', 'This picture begs a story to be told with it.  A shallower depth of field would have isolated your subject from the background a little better.', '2007-03-04 14:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
