(3431997, 477210, 50695, '<td valign="top">the joys of this photo are subtle, but profound. If I sit with it for just two moments, it transports me to I-don''t-know-where and I-don''t-know-when, and I wonder if it''s someplace I come from, someplace I belong. the precipitation is as beautiful as any I''ve ever seen. 10</td>', 'the joys of this photo are subtle, but profound. If I sit with it for just two moments, it transports me to I-don''t-know-where and I-don''t-know-when, and I wonder if it''s someplace I come from, someplace I belong. the precipitation is as beautiful as any I''ve ever seen. 10', '2007-03-05 20:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3431999, 475267, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this type of shot (or most things that are a "type of shot"), but this is magnificently done. 8</td>', 'I don''t like this type of shot (or most things that are a "type of shot"), but this is magnificently done. 8', '2007-03-05 20:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
