(3432021, 477198, 50695, '<td valign="top">expert use of dof and a framing device. You know how to take a picture. Now get out of here before dpc ruins you. 9</td>', 'expert use of dof and a framing device. You know how to take a picture. Now get out of here before dpc ruins you. 9', '2007-03-05 20:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
