(3433596, 477467, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the attempt at high key.  but a lot of it looks simply blown-out.  still, it''s an attention grabber.</td>', 'I like the attempt at high key.  but a lot of it looks simply blown-out.  still, it''s an attention grabber.', '2007-03-06 11:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433598, 474078, 66193, '<td valign="top">would have been perfect without that shadow in the upper right.  Nice job controlling the exposure.</td>', 'would have been perfect without that shadow in the upper right.  Nice job controlling the exposure.', '2007-03-06 11:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433603, 476772, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract here.  Although, in my opinion, the title detracts away from the power of the abstractness.  could''ve left the voters wondering a little more!  well done.</td>', 'I like the abstract here.  Although, in my opinion, the title detracts away from the power of the abstractness.  could''ve left the voters wondering a little more!  well done.', '2007-03-06 11:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433607, 477016, 66193, '<td valign="top">I love the wide-angle landscapes in portrait mode.  nice job with the DOF, and I like the processing in B&amp;W. 9</td>', 'I love the wide-angle landscapes in portrait mode.  nice job with the DOF, and I like the processing in B&W. 9', '2007-03-06 11:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433609, 477420, 30049, '<td valign="top">I understand the use of negative space at times.  In this case, I think it''s too much and puts the line of people too close to the horizontal mid-point.  A classic ROT crop would have given this a stronger presentation IMO.  I like the movement suggested by the person at the bottom as he moves into the photo, and the line of people is interesting to look at/wonder about.<br/> <br/>Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I understand the use of negative space at times.  In this case, I think it''s too much and puts the line of people too close to the horizontal mid-point.  A classic ROT crop would have given this a stronger presentation IMO.  I like the movement suggested by the person at the bottom as he moves into the photo, and the line of people is interesting to look at/wonder about. Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-03-06 11:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433612, 465350, 66193, '<td valign="top">almost missed her head there for a second.</td>', 'almost missed her head there for a second.', '2007-03-06 11:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433625, 476588, 66193, '<td valign="top">would''ve been great for Low Key, too.</td>', 'would''ve been great for Low Key, too.', '2007-03-06 11:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433628, 476175, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think a small boost in contrast would help this image.  Also, the sky is distracting IMO - did you look at this cropped without the sky?  Just a thought.  I like the idea and the colors are nice.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think a small boost in contrast would help this image.  Also, the sky is distracting IMO - did you look at this cropped without the sky?  Just a thought.  I like the idea and the colors are nice. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-06 11:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433629, 477348, 66193, '<td valign="top">i love the tones here.</td>', 'i love the tones here.', '2007-03-06 11:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433641, 467127, 66193, '<td valign="top">it does evoke the 40''s or 50''s starlet image.  Perhaps darkening the pillows would have placed more emphasis on her.</td>', 'it does evoke the 40''s or 50''s starlet image.  Perhaps darkening the pillows would have placed more emphasis on her.', '2007-03-06 11:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433674, 477203, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cute capture.  Wish your shutter speed was a tad faster to truly stop the motion and eliminate the blur.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute capture.  Wish your shutter speed was a tad faster to truly stop the motion and eliminate the blur.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-06 11:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3433683, 475600, 30049, '<td valign="top">Why in the world does this have a validation stamp on it?  It''s a nice image as a landscape.  Perhaps someone thought the sky was from another image?  There is some sharpening halo over the mountains that is a little distracting.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Why in the world does this have a validation stamp on it?  It''s a nice image as a landscape.  Perhaps someone thought the sky was from another image?  There is some sharpening halo over the mountains that is a little distracting.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-06 12:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
