(3434195, 476366, 31403, '<td valign="top">an amazingly difficult sport to photograph - I haven''t seen it done much better than this.  I''m not sure how you could do better - having been at "mat-side" shooting - I know how hard it is to convey what these guys truly go through - certainly worthy of a magazine or newspaper publication - I''ve shot far less of photos of wrestling that have been published!</td>', 'an amazingly difficult sport to photograph - I haven''t seen it done much better than this.  I''m not sure how you could do better - having been at "mat-side" shooting - I know how hard it is to convey what these guys truly go through - certainly worthy of a magazine or newspaper publication - I''ve shot far less of photos of wrestling that have been published!', '2007-03-06 14:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3434197, 477149, 54540, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic!  My eye started at the title, went straight to the couple, wandered over the scene, the fog, the time of day, the temperature, and back to the couple.  Well done and best of luck to you in the challenge!</td>', 'This is fantastic!  My eye started at the title, went straight to the couple, wandered over the scene, the fog, the time of day, the temperature, and back to the couple.  Well done and best of luck to you in the challenge!', '2007-03-06 14:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
