(3435246, 472156, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the sky, and farm in the background. Really like your composition also. Very nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the sky, and farm in the background. Really like your composition also. Very nice work.', '2007-03-06 22:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435258, 477392, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful child. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful child. Nice lighting.', '2007-03-06 22:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435259, 477001, 70514, '<td valign="top">That''s so pretty, it doesn''t even look like ice.</td>', 'That''s so pretty, it doesn''t even look like ice.', '2007-03-06 22:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435262, 474577, 50695, '<td valign="top">Some mad genius has stolen one of bucket''s photo and found a photo inside it. My guess is that you''re a frustrated poet, a haiku-writer to be more precise, who became obsessed with the beauty of bucket''s work. Finally, you couldn''t take it any longer. It wasn''t enough to merely write comments about bucket''s photo this time. You had to inhabit the picture, find your own picture within his picture. Indeed, you are a stealer of souls, as are all artists. And as with all master thieves, the thing you have stolen has now become your own. I can only give this a 10. It is a brief, stunning poem of light.</td>', 'Some mad genius has stolen one of bucket''s photo and found a photo inside it. My guess is that you''re a frustrated poet, a haiku-writer to be more precise, who became obsessed with the beauty of bucket''s work. Finally, you couldn''t take it any longer. It wasn''t enough to merely write comments about bucket''s photo this time. You had to inhabit the picture, find your own picture within his picture. Indeed, you are a stealer of souls, as are all artists. And as with all master thieves, the thing you have stolen has now become your own. I can only give this a 10. It is a brief, stunning poem of light.', '2007-03-06 22:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435263, 472870, 50695, '<td valign="top">Excellent. You have pushed the cliche right off the map. 9</td>', 'Excellent. You have pushed the cliche right off the map. 9', '2007-03-06 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435264, 467603, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice light to make the winner stand out.  Interesting how the winner looks so beat. Great capture.</td>', 'Nice light to make the winner stand out.  Interesting how the winner looks so beat. Great capture.', '2007-03-06 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435267, 474775, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen. This truly lives up to the title. 10</td>', 'Nicely seen. This truly lives up to the title. 10', '2007-03-06 22:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435270, 474125, 50695, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light to convey a dark environment but at the same time to brilliantly illuminate your subject. 8</td>', 'Excellent use of light to convey a dark environment but at the same time to brilliantly illuminate your subject. 8', '2007-03-06 22:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435272, 476971, 70514, '<td valign="top">IMO, it seems blurry.</td>', 'IMO, it seems blurry.', '2007-03-06 22:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435276, 474716, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard of waves of grain, but I''ve never seen them crashing on a shore. Redefining reality is all about photography. 10</td>', 'I''ve heard of waves of grain, but I''ve never seen them crashing on a shore. Redefining reality is all about photography. 10', '2007-03-06 22:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435280, 467127, 50695, '<td valign="top">There''s a poignant frisson between the title and the photo. She seems sad and vulnerable in a non-starlet sort of way. She seems instead like a regular person with make-up and fancy lights. I identify with her instead of desiring her or desiring to be her. I feel what I imagine she is feeling. Interesting to note that the camera is not merely observing in this case, but is actually an active contributor to her vulnerability and sadness. I feel almost as though I am hurting her and feeling her hurt at the same time, an awkward but moving experience. 9</td>', 'There''s a poignant frisson between the title and the photo. She seems sad and vulnerable in a non-starlet sort of way. She seems instead like a regular person with make-up and fancy lights. I identify with her instead of desiring her or desiring to be her. I feel what I imagine she is feeling. Interesting to note that the camera is not merely observing in this case, but is actually an active contributor to her vulnerability and sadness. I feel almost as though I am hurting her and feeling her hurt at the same time, an awkward but moving experience. 9', '2007-03-06 22:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435287, 471853, 50695, '<td valign="top">at first, the vignetting turned me off, but now I''m not so sure. I''m starting to think it represents an impaired vision, a tunnel vision. Perhaps if it were more irregular? It is a striking image. I''ll give it a 7.</td>', 'at first, the vignetting turned me off, but now I''m not so sure. I''m starting to think it represents an impaired vision, a tunnel vision. Perhaps if it were more irregular? It is a striking image. I''ll give it a 7.', '2007-03-06 22:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435289, 475920, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m cool with the funky processing, but the path itself doesn''t look right, and it''s calling too much attention to itself instead of integrating into the image. I''ll give you a 6. It could''ve been higher! :)</td>', 'I''m cool with the funky processing, but the path itself doesn''t look right, and it''s calling too much attention to itself instead of integrating into the image. I''ll give you a 6. It could''ve been higher! :)', '2007-03-06 22:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435293, 474927, 50695, '<td valign="top">They need to relax. One thing that disturbs me a little is I can sense some vulnerability in the woman, but the man is a complete cipher.</td>', 'They need to relax. One thing that disturbs me a little is I can sense some vulnerability in the woman, but the man is a complete cipher.', '2007-03-06 22:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435299, 467794, 50695, '<td valign="top">he blends into the graffiti. well done. 7</td>', 'he blends into the graffiti. well done. 7', '2007-03-06 22:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435302, 470946, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. That tiny blur of motion signifying his right hand is what sets this photo apart. Also the dark shape above his head showing a square quality, which contrasts to the round quality of the item being weaved. His face and left hand are so beautiful, more beautiful than anything he could create. His shirt seems woven into the wall. The man is one with his environment. This is as good as "environmental portrait" gets. 10</td>', 'Beautiful. That tiny blur of motion signifying his right hand is what sets this photo apart. Also the dark shape above his head showing a square quality, which contrasts to the round quality of the item being weaved. His face and left hand are so beautiful, more beautiful than anything he could create. His shirt seems woven into the wall. The man is one with his environment. This is as good as "environmental portrait" gets. 10', '2007-03-06 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435304, 473782, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m giving you an extra point for calling this soaring but having the bird pointed down. 7</td>', 'I''m giving you an extra point for calling this soaring but having the bird pointed down. 7', '2007-03-06 22:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435310, 477435, 50695, '<td valign="top">wow, I just loved the experience of slowly figuring out what is in this picture. It felt as though he materialized from branches of the tree. It was quite a spiritual experience, actually. 9</td>', 'wow, I just loved the experience of slowly figuring out what is in this picture. It felt as though he materialized from branches of the tree. It was quite a spiritual experience, actually. 9', '2007-03-06 22:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435313, 470619, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely subject, but I wish you''d found a better composition/framing solution than that odd half-vignette. 6</td>', 'lovely subject, but I wish you''d found a better composition/framing solution than that odd half-vignette. 6', '2007-03-06 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435315, 476886, 50695, '<td valign="top">great subject and wonderful overall twisting of shapes into a very dynamic image. 7</td>', 'great subject and wonderful overall twisting of shapes into a very dynamic image. 7', '2007-03-06 22:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435319, 476728, 50695, '<td valign="top">Ah, this is a true pleasure to this old pen-and-inker''s eye. 8</td>', 'Ah, this is a true pleasure to this old pen-and-inker''s eye. 8', '2007-03-06 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3435322, 475547, 50695, '<td valign="top">campy, sentimental, beautiful, bold. 8</td>', 'campy, sentimental, beautiful, bold. 8', '2007-03-06 22:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
