(3436311, 477198, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great shot - Been a while looking through these and this one stands out - Love the light - You have captured some personality here which so many portraits don''t - If there is one thing that is a little distracting it''s the halo around the head from the dodging - Could just do with a little extra burn to make it just look perfect. Really lovely though well done.10</td>', 'Great shot - Been a while looking through these and this one stands out - Love the light - You have captured some personality here which so many portraits don''t - If there is one thing that is a little distracting it''s the halo around the head from the dodging - Could just do with a little extra burn to make it just look perfect. Really lovely though well done.10', '2007-03-07 03:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
