(3436313, 475547, 3669, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL! I really like the effects on the water.  The swan might be a tad dark to my liking, but the lighting on the water is enchanting.  8</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL! I really like the effects on the water.  The swan might be a tad dark to my liking, but the lighting on the water is enchanting.  8', '2007-03-07 03:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
