(3436319, 477019, 57378, '<td valign="top">What a lovely image - Think this could have been a winner if it wasn''t for that tree coming out from the horse. What a shame - Still a great image though. Don''t get me wrong I love the tree and feel it adds to the pic but the guy needed to be either more left without going into the posts or better yet more to the right before the tree.</td>', 'What a lovely image - Think this could have been a winner if it wasn''t for that tree coming out from the horse. What a shame - Still a great image though. Don''t get me wrong I love the tree and feel it adds to the pic but the guy needed to be either more left without going into the posts or better yet more to the right before the tree.', '2007-03-07 03:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
