(3439092, 477122, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and nearly pulled off.  Whatever is holding the falling petal is distracting - I''d have cloned that out.  Same with the seam in the middle of the table running under the vase.  The flowers themselves are well lit and focused.  The horizon line of the table is running off to the right (rotate counter-clockwise about 2 degrees to straighten out).  Close, but not quite there (the small details are important).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute idea and nearly pulled off.  Whatever is holding the falling petal is distracting - I''d have cloned that out.  Same with the seam in the middle of the table running under the vase.  The flowers themselves are well lit and focused.  The horizon line of the table is running off to the right (rotate counter-clockwise about 2 degrees to straighten out).  Close, but not quite there (the small details are important).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-07 15:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439104, 475673, 68586, '<td valign="top">fabulous looking sheep !! My only wish is that it had it''s feet in the picture.</td>', 'fabulous looking sheep !! My only wish is that it had it''s feet in the picture.', '2007-03-07 15:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3439112, 462867, 30049, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on getting a nice photo without post-processing.  Would be excellent for a ''Minimal Editing'' challenge.  As it is, you''re competing in the ''Advanced'' ruleset.  Some minor tweaks to this would place it substantially higher in the final voting results IMO.  BTW - the long descriptive titles - they usually hinder more than help with many voters.  Just an observation.<br/> <br/>Overall, a very nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Congratulations on getting a nice photo without post-processing.  Would be excellent for a ''Minimal Editing'' challenge.  As it is, you''re competing in the ''Advanced'' ruleset.  Some minor tweaks to this would place it substantially higher in the final voting results IMO.  BTW - the long descriptive titles - they usually hinder more than help with many voters.  Just an observation. Overall, a very nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-07 15:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
