(3441184, 468746, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice find and a good eye to see it.  I can''t help but wonder if there is another time of day (more flattering light, perhaps some clouds, and glassy still water) to revisit this and possibly another angle (higher elevation to eliminate distant shoreline).  It''s a nice shot overall but leaves me wanting more.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice find and a good eye to see it.  I can''t help but wonder if there is another time of day (more flattering light, perhaps some clouds, and glassy still water) to revisit this and possibly another angle (higher elevation to eliminate distant shoreline).  It''s a nice shot overall but leaves me wanting more.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-07 23:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
