(3441877, 477499, 18505, '<td valign="top">I guess I expected this to do much better than it did. I was lucky to be where I was when the moment happened.  This young man was a senior in high school who has been working very hard to qualify for the State Wrestling Tournament, and this was the moment he did, after winning a very hard fought match.  His coach brimming over with pride, and this was his congratulatory hug.  Totally the real deal.</td>', 'I guess I expected this to do much better than it did. I was lucky to be where I was when the moment happened.  This young man was a senior in high school who has been working very hard to qualify for the State Wrestling Tournament, and this was the moment he did, after winning a very hard fought match.  His coach brimming over with pride, and this was his congratulatory hug.  Totally the real deal.', '2007-03-08 03:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3441880, 477202, 10390, '<td valign="top">How proud can a father be!<br/> <br/>Til hamingju, þetta er alveg frábært hjá þér!!</td>', 'How proud can a father be! Til hamingju, þetta er alveg frábært hjá þér!!', '2007-03-08 03:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3441885, 477202, 68546, '<td valign="top">WOW!! what a start, 2nd entry and a ribbon. And at 9 years old as well! The picture is amazing, well done</td>', 'WOW!! what a start, 2nd entry and a ribbon. And at 9 years old as well! The picture is amazing, well done', '2007-03-08 03:18:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3441887, 470946, 54033, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Xilebo:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations with this excellent shot, like everything about it.. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks all for some very kind words on this photo, really made me happy; however some comments pointed that the photo was "top heavy" or "needed some cropping from the top" or "had a darker top", and I do appreciate these comments too, but I like to share my thought on why :"I left that dark area", with those who saw it my way and who saw it differently; simply, this guys works day in and day out trying to make an honest living with burdens of life getting heavier everyday and this sense of need a responsibility is greatly felt as one spend few minutes with him; so the top dark heavy area reflects an inside feel I had on this guys heavy load of need and burdens; and I just could not crop it out</td>', 'Originally posted by Xilebo: Congratulations with this excellent shot, like everything about it..   Thanks all for some very kind words on this photo, really made me happy; however some comments pointed that the photo was "top heavy" or "needed some cropping from the top" or "had a darker top", and I do appreciate these comments too, but I like to share my thought on why :"I left that dark area", with those who saw it my way and who saw it differently; simply, this guys works day in and day out trying to make an honest living with burdens of life getting heavier everyday and this sense of need a responsibility is greatly felt as one spend few minutes with him; so the top dark heavy area reflects an inside feel I had on this guys heavy load of need and burdens; and I just could not crop it out', '2007-03-08 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3441896, 477116, 16241, '<td valign="top">holy moly, do you have ghost accounts?  haha<br/>kidding, beautiful, you have a good eye when it comes to composition.</td>', 'holy moly, do you have ghost accounts?  hahakidding, beautiful, you have a good eye when it comes to composition.', '2007-03-08 03:24:18.000000', NULL, 0),
