(3442428, 469377, 15305, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, very deep and insightful.<br/>Your India Collection shows you''ve grown as a photographer and an artist with the sensitivity to feel and convey the alternate realities in our world. <br/>Your photographic skills to capture the moment, along with your masterful editing techniques gives us a collection worthy of any old seasoned photographer working for National Geographic.<br/>Congratulations Joey, and I hope you keep sharing your wonderful work with us.</td>', 'Amazing shot, very deep and insightful.Your India Collection shows you''ve grown as a photographer and an artist with the sensitivity to feel and convey the alternate realities in our world. Your photographic skills to capture the moment, along with your masterful editing techniques gives us a collection worthy of any old seasoned photographer working for National Geographic.Congratulations Joey, and I hope you keep sharing your wonderful work with us.', '2007-03-08 08:35:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3442433, 475984, 14620, '<td valign="top">Honestly, I don''t know what some people are thinking.  There is no way possible that this should be down here with this silly, silly score. :(</td>', 'Honestly, I don''t know what some people are thinking.  There is no way possible that this should be down here with this silly, silly score. :(', '2007-03-08 08:36:50.000000', NULL, 0),
