(3442470, 476480, 23484, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot. I sat and stared at this for a while. It has such an old German feel to it. Maybe it''s the architecture. Congrats on a nice score.</td>', 'GREAT shot. I sat and stared at this for a while. It has such an old German feel to it. Maybe it''s the architecture. Congrats on a nice score.', '2007-03-08 08:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(3442473, 469377, 60614, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Congratulations on your finish.  This was definately a tough challenge.  So many great photos.  I love the feel of this photo.  I wish I was better at putting my feelings into to words but I am not.  Trust me when I say this is a fantastice photo in every way and it deserved to be on the front page.  Hope to be as good as you one day.  See you in the future challenges.</td>', 'Wow.  Congratulations on your finish.  This was definately a tough challenge.  So many great photos.  I love the feel of this photo.  I wish I was better at putting my feelings into to words but I am not.  Trust me when I say this is a fantastice photo in every way and it deserved to be on the front page.  Hope to be as good as you one day.  See you in the future challenges.', '2007-03-08 08:48:41.000000', NULL, 0),
