(3442510, 474896, 57981, '<td valign="top">bravo lori!!! this is a beautiful photograph ... you missed the top 10, but it was damn close. you deserved to be up there!!<br/> <br/>a personal best for you AND a +7 score. great result! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-08 09:09:51.</i></td>', 'bravo lori!!! this is a beautiful photograph ... you missed the top 10, but it was damn close. you deserved to be up there!! a personal best for you AND a +7 score. great result! :)', '2007-03-08 09:09:03.000000', '2007-03-08 09:09:51.000000', 0),
