(3442517, 477021, 70299, '<td valign="top">This is soooo amazing.  I always look forward to seeing your great images of the borealis in Iceland.  My new travel destination!  I am definitely going to be ordering the largest print when I get moved to my new house here shortly!  Thank you for providing this!  Again...AMAZING!</td>', 'This is soooo amazing.  I always look forward to seeing your great images of the borealis in Iceland.  My new travel destination!  I am definitely going to be ordering the largest print when I get moved to my new house here shortly!  Thank you for providing this!  Again...AMAZING!', '2007-03-08 09:14:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3442518, 469377, 70107, '<td valign="top">I have no idea why this image placed third. This is obviously a well thought, well rounded photo, with great composition and colour. And the most beautiful old man that could ever be photographed.<br/>I dont know why pictures that are continuously being repeated of the same surrounding keep winning. They are good, but they are just getting old to me.<br/>Amazing work</td>', 'I have no idea why this image placed third. This is obviously a well thought, well rounded photo, with great composition and colour. And the most beautiful old man that could ever be photographed.I dont know why pictures that are continuously being repeated of the same surrounding keep winning. They are good, but they are just getting old to me.Amazing work', '2007-03-08 09:15:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3442525, 477106, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Where''s the rest of the story???  :D  C''mon - tell us what happened.  Inquiring photog''s want to know!  :)</td>', 'Hey!  Where''s the rest of the story???  :D  C''mon - tell us what happened.  Inquiring photog''s want to know!  :)', '2007-03-08 09:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
