(3442706, 477018, 26001, '<td valign="top">exposure, lighting, composition everything is excellent. the gazing pose, out of the frame, is outstanding. although the dof seems to cover mainly man''s chest/hand/scarf/lower jaw only, not his upper-face/eye. I like this image though.</td>', 'exposure, lighting, composition everything is excellent. the gazing pose, out of the frame, is outstanding. although the dof seems to cover mainly man''s chest/hand/scarf/lower jaw only, not his upper-face/eye. I like this image though.', '2007-03-08 10:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
