(3442731, 477021, 70181, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What an incredible photo.  How did it only average a 7.6?  Anybody that didn''t vote a 10 should be shot.  :)</td>', 'Wow!  What an incredible photo.  How did it only average a 7.6?  Anybody that didn''t vote a 10 should be shot.  :)', '2007-03-08 10:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3442743, 477021, 2333, '<td valign="top">Ha, now you''re smokin! That 24/1.4L sure is crisp. Love the composition. The fence &amp; road lead the eye right to the farm, then the combination of the star field and aurora lead it around and back in a loop. Perfect. I even like the little bank of illuminated cloud. Was there any moonlight on the foreground, or is all that from the aurora? I suspect that you had at least some moonlight...<br/>Edit to add: you also captured M31, the great galaxy in Andromeda. It''s the fuzzy, bright bluish "star" near upper left.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-08 10:41:05.</i></td>', 'Ha, now you''re smokin! That 24/1.4L sure is crisp. Love the composition. The fence & road lead the eye right to the farm, then the combination of the star field and aurora lead it around and back in a loop. Perfect. I even like the little bank of illuminated cloud. Was there any moonlight on the foreground, or is all that from the aurora? I suspect that you had at least some moonlight...Edit to add: you also captured M31, the great galaxy in Andromeda. It''s the fuzzy, bright bluish "star" near upper left.', '2007-03-08 10:25:12.000000', '2007-03-08 10:41:05.000000', 0),
(3442754, 477202, 56361, '<td valign="top">Holly crap are you seriously 9 (!!!) years old?!?!?! you got talent, girl... This is absolutly beautifull...</td>', 'Holly crap are you seriously 9 (!!!) years old?!?!?! you got talent, girl... This is absolutly beautifull...', '2007-03-08 10:31:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3442759, 474666, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is quite the whimsy shot. I really like the conceptual part of it. Them being b/w lost in a sea of color. Not sure the shot would''ve worked as well with the concept you had in mind had they been in color. But I imagine I would''ve liked the shot either way. I might add this was one of the few shots that really made me think and pause the longest. I like that :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-08 10:37:17.</i></td>', 'This is quite the whimsy shot. I really like the conceptual part of it. Them being b/w lost in a sea of color. Not sure the shot would''ve worked as well with the concept you had in mind had they been in color. But I imagine I would''ve liked the shot either way. I might add this was one of the few shots that really made me think and pause the longest. I like that :)', '2007-03-08 10:36:10.000000', '2007-03-08 10:37:17.000000', 0),
(3442763, 475785, 69325, '<td valign="top">i think you got robbed on this,but with over 600 entries i guess thats bound to happen</td>', 'i think you got robbed on this,but with over 600 entries i guess thats bound to happen', '2007-03-08 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
