(3443119, 475963, 62318, '<td valign="top">I love the processing on this one. It has a really nice mood to the photo.  Technically it is well done. The composition is a little one dimensional though, what I mean is everything is more or less on the same plane. Maybe getting close to those reeds on the right and using a wider angle to keep the same perspective? Dunno, I really like the photo though (especially that barn). Should have scored much higher at any rate. I don''t know how people can vote 2''s in a Free Study, it''s not like a DNMC...</td>', 'I love the processing on this one. It has a really nice mood to the photo.  Technically it is well done. The composition is a little one dimensional though, what I mean is everything is more or less on the same plane. Maybe getting close to those reeds on the right and using a wider angle to keep the same perspective? Dunno, I really like the photo though (especially that barn). Should have scored much higher at any rate. I don''t know how people can vote 2''s in a Free Study, it''s not like a DNMC...', '2007-03-08 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
