(3443383, 476658, 42100, '<td valign="top">I don''t see what you think is cheesy about this photo at all.  I like the little story that''s going on with how the children are so fascinated with him, yet he seems more concerned with you.  He''s definitely telling you something with that body language...now to figure out what.<br/> <br/>Well done and ''grats on the new PB!</td>', 'I don''t see what you think is cheesy about this photo at all.  I like the little story that''s going on with how the children are so fascinated with him, yet he seems more concerned with you.  He''s definitely telling you something with that body language...now to figure out what. Well done and ''grats on the new PB!', '2007-03-08 13:43:07.000000', NULL, 0),
