(3443747, 476486, 50695, '<td valign="top">Greetings from Critique Club!<br/> <br/>I gave this a 6. Really it was a 6 and a half, very close to a 7. I like the simplicity of this image. The "lost" details and "blown" highlights on the church work nicely, imho. My only problem with the image is the pigeon, actually. I just want him to be a bit more vivid, or stand out in some way. Is that a shadow on his neck? I don''t like that much. I also wonder if a square crop might have accentuated the iconic quality of this image.<br/> <br/>Nicely seen and captured. Thank you!</td>', 'Greetings from Critique Club! I gave this a 6. Really it was a 6 and a half, very close to a 7. I like the simplicity of this image. The "lost" details and "blown" highlights on the church work nicely, imho. My only problem with the image is the pigeon, actually. I just want him to be a bit more vivid, or stand out in some way. Is that a shadow on his neck? I don''t like that much. I also wonder if a square crop might have accentuated the iconic quality of this image. Nicely seen and captured. Thank you!', '2007-03-08 15:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
