(3444421, 469377, 38648, '<td valign="top">What can I say that others haven''t done so already?  This is one of my favorite shots that you have taken and shared. "Fantastic" is just not adequate.<br/> <br/>I took a few minutes to review your India Collection and was equally impressed.  You are very talented and your skills are evolving into a consumate professional. The command you have over your tools is amazing. I only wish I had 1/10th of your talent.  Congrats and keep up the great work.</td>', 'What can I say that others haven''t done so already?  This is one of my favorite shots that you have taken and shared. "Fantastic" is just not adequate. I took a few minutes to review your India Collection and was equally impressed.  You are very talented and your skills are evolving into a consumate professional. The command you have over your tools is amazing. I only wish I had 1/10th of your talent.  Congrats and keep up the great work.', '2007-03-08 19:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3444438, 477202, 16493, '<td valign="top">After all there nice comments for a red ribbon - Now she will not stop until she gets a blue one too.<br/>Look forward to see her future entries in the challenges.</td>', 'After all there nice comments for a red ribbon - Now she will not stop until she gets a blue one too.Look forward to see her future entries in the challenges.', '2007-03-08 19:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3444448, 477021, 75266, '<td valign="top">Frábær mynd hjá þér Lárus.<br/>Þó að Arna stal dálítið athyglinni með því að vera níu ára ;)<br/>Flottasta norðurljósamynd sem ég hef séð.<br/>Favourite.</td>', 'Frábær mynd hjá þér Lárus.Þó að Arna stal dálítið athyglinni með því að vera níu ára ;)Flottasta norðurljósamynd sem ég hef séð.Favourite.', '2007-03-08 19:41:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3444480, 474856, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by option:</b></div><hr/><i> Haha wow, am I the only one that didn''t actually like this shot?  :-P<br/> <br/>Congrats on the high score, I guess I''m just not feelin'' the HDR.  It''s clear that mine is a fringe opinion, so I''ll just be quiet now... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL, we''re all entitled to our opinions, no matter how screwed up they are. ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by option: Haha wow, am I the only one that didn''t actually like this shot?  :-P Congrats on the high score, I guess I''m just not feelin'' the HDR.  It''s clear that mine is a fringe opinion, so I''ll just be quiet now...  LOL, we''re all entitled to our opinions, no matter how screwed up they are. ;-)', '2007-03-08 19:48:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3444502, 473095, 74078, '<td valign="top">Great composition and capture. I think that the comments should be made more on the photographers work rather than the model used. I am sure that the photography had no say in what size implants she chose.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a great image Sarcoman</td>', 'Great composition and capture. I think that the comments should be made more on the photographers work rather than the model used. I am sure that the photography had no say in what size implants she chose. Congratulations on a great image Sarcoman', '2007-03-08 20:03:36.000000', NULL, 0);
