(3444534, 464490, 14620, '<td valign="top">Too Cute!  Gotta love a little poser like that. :)  Does standing like that help any?  If so, I''ve gotta give it a try. :)</td>', 'Too Cute!  Gotta love a little poser like that. :)  Does standing like that help any?  If so, I''ve gotta give it a try. :)', '2007-03-08 20:19:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(3444535, 477019, 66384, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on an awesome shot. I scored it a 10. It seems a number of others agreed with me. Terrific finish. I''m glad you didn''t wind up in the ditch -- we might not have seen this. :P</td>', 'Congratulations on an awesome shot. I scored it a 10. It seems a number of others agreed with me. Terrific finish. I''m glad you didn''t wind up in the ditch -- we might not have seen this. :P', '2007-03-08 20:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3444543, 473095, 14620, '<td valign="top">I''m saddened by the comments made about the models "attributes", like it''s something you can control.  Quite silly and unnecessary really.  I agree that comments should be kept to the photograph and it''s technicalities.  It was a wonderful thing for this model to sit for you.  But comments like those you recieved will really make me think thrice about subjecting a model to such scrutiny.  I think the photo is lovely and if I had any nitpicks about it (other than the background problems you mentioned which I cannot see on my monitor) is that I would have liked to see her face a little sharper. :)</td>', 'I''m saddened by the comments made about the models "attributes", like it''s something you can control.  Quite silly and unnecessary really.  I agree that comments should be kept to the photograph and it''s technicalities.  It was a wonderful thing for this model to sit for you.  But comments like those you recieved will really make me think thrice about subjecting a model to such scrutiny.  I think the photo is lovely and if I had any nitpicks about it (other than the background problems you mentioned which I cannot see on my monitor) is that I would have liked to see her face a little sharper. :)', '2007-03-08 20:27:31.000000', NULL, 0),
