href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=477321" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/631/thumb/477321.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/631/thumb/477321.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/631/thumb/477321.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-09 14:27:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Jmnuggy: Is this a composition of two photos?  I was looking at your portfolio and this photo and 2 others had the same smoke stack and mountains but all had different foregrounds.  Just curious.   No this is NOT an illegal entry! Accusations of cheating against a nine year old.. how low is that!You are at least making people think about if this is illegal or not.More here.. You can be certain that I will not translate this for her! grrrYou should investigate before coming up with something like this! This one is taken on the other side of the bridge in the same direction, closer to the steam stack:  And this one is taken maybe half an hour later about 200m (1/8 mile) from where the ribbon image was taken, and also in the same direction:  Even this one has yet another foreground but the same steam stack, I took it 3 days earlier not far from where Arna Rós took her great photos:', '2007-03-09 13:36:36.000000', '2007-03-09 14:27:27.000000', 0),
