(3447452, 473095, 50641, '<td valign="top">Hi.  Sorry this didn''t do as well as you''d hoped. At least you didn''t get dq''d for genitalia. Thank you for not taking my previous comment the wrong way ;-)  I just came back to tell you that I find the look on the model''s face really engaging. Her pose is defiant, yet subtly so.  Regal perhaps.  I enjoyed it very much.  With all that going on, I imagine that if the sash had been positioned <i>over</i> the naughty bits, it might have been an even stronger shot.  I hope you get a chance to use her as a model again. Good luck :)</td>', 'Hi.  Sorry this didn''t do as well as you''d hoped. At least you didn''t get dq''d for genitalia. Thank you for not taking my previous comment the wrong way ;-)  I just came back to tell you that I find the look on the model''s face really engaging. Her pose is defiant, yet subtly so.  Regal perhaps.  I enjoyed it very much.  With all that going on, I imagine that if the sash had been positioned over the naughty bits, it might have been an even stronger shot.  I hope you get a chance to use her as a model again. Good luck :)', '2007-03-09 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
