(3447971, 474856, 64176, '<td valign="top">I''ll tiptoe meekly out so Option doesn''t have to stand alone.  It''s beautiful, but to me, it doesn''t look like a photograph.  It looks more like a painting.  Too overprocessed for my tastes too.  I''d like to see the original.  I feel like sometimes Photoshop is cheating because it allows you to "paint" over the original photograph.  Just my 2 cents.  But congrats on your high placement.  :::goes to stand in the corner with Option:::</td>', 'I''ll tiptoe meekly out so Option doesn''t have to stand alone.  It''s beautiful, but to me, it doesn''t look like a photograph.  It looks more like a painting.  Too overprocessed for my tastes too.  I''d like to see the original.  I feel like sometimes Photoshop is cheating because it allows you to "paint" over the original photograph.  Just my 2 cents.  But congrats on your high placement.  :::goes to stand in the corner with Option:::', '2007-03-10 02:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
