(3448204, 477392, 55838, '<td valign="top">Oh what a sweet little face.  Something about her eyes makes her look older her years.  I like the b&amp;w and the contrast - maybe bringing out the blacks even more would be nice.  About your score...I didn''t vote in this challenge but I think that a wee bit sharper focus would have given you a boost and aside from that, it''s the face of a child and for some reason the voters are often harsh on pic''s of children.  I don''t understand it either!  Big heartless meanies!!</td>', 'Oh what a sweet little face.  Something about her eyes makes her look older her years.  I like the b&w and the contrast - maybe bringing out the blacks even more would be nice.  About your score...I didn''t vote in this challenge but I think that a wee bit sharper focus would have given you a boost and aside from that, it''s the face of a child and for some reason the voters are often harsh on pic''s of children.  I don''t understand it either!  Big heartless meanies!!', '2007-03-10 07:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3448251, 477446, 55838, '<td valign="top">Wow - I can''t believe this only got a 5.7.  I really like the cool balance of the building in one corner and the moon in the other.  Outstanding colors too.  Lovely gradient in the sky.  Cool border too.  From one of your thirty-two 7''s.</td>', 'Wow - I can''t believe this only got a 5.7.  I really like the cool balance of the building in one corner and the moon in the other.  Outstanding colors too.  Lovely gradient in the sky.  Cool border too.  From one of your thirty-two 7''s.', '2007-03-10 08:28:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3448283, 477017, 53147, '<td valign="top">I think you got robbed here. While maybe not as sharp as many would want, I think your composition and colors make up for it in spades. This shot just makes me smile.</td>', 'I think you got robbed here. While maybe not as sharp as many would want, I think your composition and colors make up for it in spades. This shot just makes me smile.', '2007-03-10 08:54:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3448304, 473641, 69722, '<td valign="top">I''ll give it a whirl - I guess the first thing that strikes me is that it makes me wonder if I am still feeling the effects of my celebratory Frday night cocktails. That said, I think I am not, and the picture would benefit from a more horizontal orientation and crop.  But I like, very much, the way I am drawn to the well-lit center of the photo, but then I am distracted by the crane overhead. I also feel like the building on the left is obtrusive, cutting off the scene I am trying to see. Maybe that''s a good thing - creates some tension for hte viewer. I like the theme of the photo - the surprise of the activity in what I feel is a dark, quiet, empty street.<br/> <br/>Okay - critiquing is hard. I really feel like I don''t know what I am doing, but I feel like I should try. I wish we had a forum for critiquing critiques.</td>', 'I''ll give it a whirl - I guess the first thing that strikes me is that it makes me wonder if I am still feeling the effects of my celebratory Frday night cocktails. That said, I think I am not, and the picture would benefit from a more horizontal orientation and crop.  But I like, very much, the way I am drawn to the well-lit center of the photo, but then I am distracted by the crane overhead. I also feel like the building on the left is obtrusive, cutting off the scene I am trying to see. Maybe that''s a good thing - creates some tension for hte viewer. I like the theme of the photo - the surprise of the activity in what I feel is a dark, quiet, empty street. Okay - critiquing is hard. I really feel like I don''t know what I am doing, but I feel like I should try. I wish we had a forum for critiquing critiques.', '2007-03-10 09:03:50.000000', NULL, 0),
