(3450270, 473095, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is a very engaging image.  So much to look at and think about.  I agree with skewsme - covering up the breasts and the pubic area would''ve added to it for me - made it more alluring.  Even covering just the nipple on the bare breast would''ve had that effect.  Much the same as how a good stripper will keep everything covered to make it more enticing until the finale.<br/> <br/>Artyste is right about making everything super bright.  But instead of messing with monitor settings that you then have to restore to normal, try just adding a brightness contrast layer and turn the brightness way up.  Then turn it off for the final image.<br/> <br/>Don''t let the people who commented on the model bother you.  A 5.8 is a perfectly fine score, and besides, many people voted much higher.  You''ll never please everyone, and nudes will always get hit by some people.  Focus on the people you connected with - 4 favorites is a better indicator than a smattering of scores in the 1-3 range.</td>', 'This is a very engaging image.  So much to look at and think about.  I agree with skewsme - covering up the breasts and the pubic area would''ve added to it for me - made it more alluring.  Even covering just the nipple on the bare breast would''ve had that effect.  Much the same as how a good stripper will keep everything covered to make it more enticing until the finale. Artyste is right about making everything super bright.  But instead of messing with monitor settings that you then have to restore to normal, try just adding a brightness contrast layer and turn the brightness way up.  Then turn it off for the final image. Don''t let the people who commented on the model bother you.  A 5.8 is a perfectly fine score, and besides, many people voted much higher.  You''ll never please everyone, and nudes will always get hit by some people.  Focus on the people you connected with - 4 favorites is a better indicator than a smattering of scores in the 1-3 range.', '2007-03-11 11:58:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3450327, 477021, 28227, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmmm   Shooting stars...wow<br/>I have tried to capture shooting stars before and that''s an amazing feat in itself.  And you get freakin 3 of them in a 20 second shutter!! Amazing!!  and then you capture the aurora and snow and mountains and and and...</td>', 'Mmmmmmmmm   Shooting stars...wowI have tried to capture shooting stars before and that''s an amazing feat in itself.  And you get freakin 3 of them in a 20 second shutter!! Amazing!!  and then you capture the aurora and snow and mountains and and and...', '2007-03-11 12:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
