(3450813, 473095, 93, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by levyj413:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>Artyste is right about making everything super bright.  But instead of messing with monitor settings that you then have to restore to normal, try just adding a brightness contrast layer and turn the brightness way up.  Then turn it off for the final image.<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Heh.. I meant punching gamma up in the processing program. Although granted, I don''t know how easy that is in other programs, but in Photoshop, you can do it with a slider.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-11 17:43:00.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by levyj413:  Artyste is right about making everything super bright.  But instead of messing with monitor settings that you then have to restore to normal, try just adding a brightness contrast layer and turn the brightness way up.  Then turn it off for the final image.  Heh.. I meant punching gamma up in the processing program. Although granted, I don''t know how easy that is in other programs, but in Photoshop, you can do it with a slider.', '2007-03-11 17:42:38.000000', '2007-03-11 17:43:00.000000', 0),
(3450833, 476658, 27763, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding!  The manatee(?) looks like something straight out of the movie "Men in Black".  Great composition and light here.  It''s great that we can not only see the manatee, but also the children''s reaction to him.  The light on the boy''s face is wonderful.  It would have been a shame if his face had been in shadow!  <br/> <br/>Well done.  Congrats on top 30 in a Free Study!</td>', 'This is outstanding!  The manatee(?) looks like something straight out of the movie "Men in Black".  Great composition and light here.  It''s great that we can not only see the manatee, but also the children''s reaction to him.  The light on the boy''s face is wonderful.  It would have been a shame if his face had been in shadow!   Well done.  Congrats on top 30 in a Free Study!', '2007-03-11 17:57:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3450854, 476658, 26464, '<td valign="top">this is surreal, like kids making contact with an alien. well done!<br/></td>', 'this is surreal, like kids making contact with an alien. well done!', '2007-03-11 18:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
