(3452431, 477202, 68059, '<td valign="top">All Icelanders are extremely proud of you.  Obviously, you are a very gifted "beginner", but it is as important to have caring and supportive family around you and you seem to have just that.  Don''t worry about envious people, the better one is, the more one encounters such individuals.  Just human nature I guess.  Keep on studying the fantastic world of photography - I think you can still learn a trick or two from your old man!</td>', 'All Icelanders are extremely proud of you.  Obviously, you are a very gifted "beginner", but it is as important to have caring and supportive family around you and you seem to have just that.  Don''t worry about envious people, the better one is, the more one encounters such individuals.  Just human nature I guess.  Keep on studying the fantastic world of photography - I think you can still learn a trick or two from your old man!', '2007-03-12 08:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3452440, 468746, 51538, '<td valign="top">Has a lot of graphic potential.  For instance, clone out the horizon line completely.  Then the horizon becomes the unseen horizontal line at which the reflection begins.  I know this is not OK with the challenge rules but you can still develop this image further for commercial potential.  You could also play around with levels and make this image a little more effective.</td>', 'Has a lot of graphic potential.  For instance, clone out the horizon line completely.  Then the horizon becomes the unseen horizontal line at which the reflection begins.  I know this is not OK with the challenge rules but you can still develop this image further for commercial potential.  You could also play around with levels and make this image a little more effective.', '2007-03-12 08:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3452619, 477106, 35357, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done post processing.  What an incredible scene!</td>', 'Very nicely done post processing.  What an incredible scene!', '2007-03-12 09:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3452739, 477200, 63244, '<td valign="top">Lance, this is amazing!! I love the detail and the colors. And the movement - WOW!</td>', 'Lance, this is amazing!! I love the detail and the colors. And the movement - WOW!', '2007-03-12 10:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3453271, 469377, 326, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! A masterpiece!</td>', 'Congratulations! A masterpiece!', '2007-03-12 12:44:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3453634, 476780, 67697, '<td valign="top">Sorry to see that this did not score higher - this is certainly not a pic belonging in the 4.8 range.  The shades of red are gorgeous and the drops of water nicely enhance the texture.  I think you did a nice job with the lighting!</td>', 'Sorry to see that this did not score higher - this is certainly not a pic belonging in the 4.8 range.  The shades of red are gorgeous and the drops of water nicely enhance the texture.  I think you did a nice job with the lighting!', '2007-03-12 14:30:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3453648, 473095, 66635, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe she''s a mother of two!  Wow!  She has a lot to be proud of to have such a body after two childbirths.  As for the picture, I really like it.  That particular shade of yellow against the black and white background is very eye-catching to me.  Her expression is wonderful - confident without being haughty.  And the flowing form of the sheet adds a VERY nice touch.  As for her breast and the tiny bit of vagina you can see, well, what''s wrong with that?  Anyone who votes down nudes just because they are nudes needs an attitude adjustment.  This is a very nice picture.</td>', 'I can''t believe she''s a mother of two!  Wow!  She has a lot to be proud of to have such a body after two childbirths.  As for the picture, I really like it.  That particular shade of yellow against the black and white background is very eye-catching to me.  Her expression is wonderful - confident without being haughty.  And the flowing form of the sheet adds a VERY nice touch.  As for her breast and the tiny bit of vagina you can see, well, what''s wrong with that?  Anyone who votes down nudes just because they are nudes needs an attitude adjustment.  This is a very nice picture.', '2007-03-12 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3453704, 465695, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''ve been really loving your shots lately. Keep up the good work! :)<br/> <br/>p.s. I honestly did not know this was you. I just loved it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-12 14:48:48.</i></td>', 'I''ve been really loving your shots lately. Keep up the good work! :) p.s. I honestly did not know this was you. I just loved it.', '2007-03-12 14:48:02.000000', '2007-03-12 14:48:48.000000', 0),
