(3455332, 477392, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, this is very nice. Clear and crisp... and oh so adorable. Great work on the b&amp;w conversion. Free studies are a tough nut to crack sometimes. So many entries to vote on, just under 400 participating but  <b>non-voting members</b> out of 617... sad.</td>', 'Oh wow, this is very nice. Clear and crisp... and oh so adorable. Great work on the b&w conversion. Free studies are a tough nut to crack sometimes. So many entries to vote on, just under 400 participating but  non-voting members out of 617... sad.', '2007-03-13 00:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
