(3455348, 468746, 67579, '<td valign="top">I like the solitude of the tree in the lake. Overall I like it quite a bit but I know its out of your control but if the water was just a little more calm it would kick it up quite a bit more. <br/> <br/>Very nice either way,<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'I like the solitude of the tree in the lake. Overall I like it quite a bit but I know its out of your control but if the water was just a little more calm it would kick it up quite a bit more.  Very nice either way, -dave', '2007-03-13 00:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455351, 464194, 45475, '<td valign="top">Woah... Aimee... this is gorgeous! I would imagine the bride and groom are well pleased with this result. I''m with yanko, how could anybody not like it? If I ever get married again ;P I''ll know who to call!</td>', 'Woah... Aimee... this is gorgeous! I would imagine the bride and groom are well pleased with this result. I''m with yanko, how could anybody not like it? If I ever get married again ;P I''ll know who to call!', '2007-03-13 00:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
