(3455358, 477446, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gosh, that is a great sky. I wonder if an even bolder crop, leaving just the dome in bottom right view, would be more dramatic...</td>', 'Gosh, that is a great sky. I wonder if an even bolder crop, leaving just the dome in bottom right view, would be more dramatic...', '2007-03-13 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455363, 477150, 45475, '<td valign="top">You''re kidding, a 5.2 for this? What a fantastic grab shot. Isn''t that what photography is about? Capturing some absurdity in every day? Excellent work Jude.</td>', 'You''re kidding, a 5.2 for this? What a fantastic grab shot. Isn''t that what photography is about? Capturing some absurdity in every day? Excellent work Jude.', '2007-03-13 00:15:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455420, 469377, 39243, '<td valign="top">First of all great shot - I think you would make a fine photojournalist or the like. 2ndly I am not sure if you intended this but ... for me this is a perfect example of a leading lines shot! A giant blue arrow showing me the path (of life). Love the India portfolio.</td>', 'First of all great shot - I think you would make a fine photojournalist or the like. 2ndly I am not sure if you intended this but ... for me this is a perfect example of a leading lines shot! A giant blue arrow showing me the path (of life). Love the India portfolio.', '2007-03-13 01:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455430, 473329, 22301, '<td valign="top">the salesman is not happy, he has many things to sell, you know everything is 20-60% off storewide and he is a man who takes his job seriously. He was head down and on a mission to pick up goods, time is money is his mantra and business is moving at break neck speed, in the back of his head he knew putting up a few more balloons outside would help him with sales this day. He looks up... who the fuck put this bus in the in MY loading dock!?! It is obvious some moron has parked in the no parking/loading zone area, the salesman is pissed and contemplates how he is going to do bodily harm to the driver of said van if he does not move immediately, maybe a swift kick to the crotch, maybe slash his tires but he realizes that this would only impede his own progress and would only make him more upset. In this instant he decides his red tie is no longer the lucky charm it used to be...</td>', 'the salesman is not happy, he has many things to sell, you know everything is 20-60% off storewide and he is a man who takes his job seriously. He was head down and on a mission to pick up goods, time is money is his mantra and business is moving at break neck speed, in the back of his head he knew putting up a few more balloons outside would help him with sales this day. He looks up... who the fuck put this bus in the in MY loading dock!?! It is obvious some moron has parked in the no parking/loading zone area, the salesman is pissed and contemplates how he is going to do bodily harm to the driver of said van if he does not move immediately, maybe a swift kick to the crotch, maybe slash his tires but he realizes that this would only impede his own progress and would only make him more upset. In this instant he decides his red tie is no longer the lucky charm it used to be...', '2007-03-13 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455436, 473329, 35669, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jdannels:</b></div><hr/><i>In this instant he decides his red tie is no longer the lucky charm it used to be... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>bravo, mr dannels :)<br/> <br/>a different take on the image than mine, but yours involves much more pain.<br/>i like it.<br/>if only the Mr Baker the van driver was to give him a cupcake and offer to buy his bright blue trolley at full price.</td>', 'Originally posted by jdannels:In this instant he decides his red tie is no longer the lucky charm it used to be...   bravo, mr dannels :) a different take on the image than mine, but yours involves much more pain.i like it.if only the Mr Baker the van driver was to give him a cupcake and offer to buy his bright blue trolley at full price.', '2007-03-13 01:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455503, 476118, 57229, '<td valign="top">Seems pretty seriously under-rated. A bit of a cliché there, maybe, but a picture you can hardly refuse to take. I guess this could be one of those ''the sunset looks too pink'' pictures (where the sunset really was pink, but it just looks false in a photograph). Do you know about the construction of the cabin? I see no cogged joints :)<br/>Never mind, you didn''t get the votes, but you''ve still got the picture.</td>', 'Seems pretty seriously under-rated. A bit of a cliché there, maybe, but a picture you can hardly refuse to take. I guess this could be one of those ''the sunset looks too pink'' pictures (where the sunset really was pink, but it just looks false in a photograph). Do you know about the construction of the cabin? I see no cogged joints :)Never mind, you didn''t get the votes, but you''ve still got the picture.', '2007-03-13 03:04:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455524, 463405, 52549, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. Great work, Richard.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. Great work, Richard.', '2007-03-13 03:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455597, 476309, 41116, '<td valign="top">Proud to say I gave you an 8 for this one. You can never predict nature, much less birds. You deserved way more than 4.9 for this. Good job showing the red on top of his head, really makes the shot interesting.</td>', 'Proud to say I gave you an 8 for this one. You can never predict nature, much less birds. You deserved way more than 4.9 for this. Good job showing the red on top of his head, really makes the shot interesting.', '2007-03-13 05:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3455609, 477446, 41337, '<td valign="top">Yikes. Way underrated!</td>', 'Yikes. Way underrated!', '2007-03-13 06:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3456381, 469377, 17851, '<td valign="top">Great job Joey!!, I love all your photos from India :).. I know I couldnt get myself to take photos of people I dont know LOL :P</td>', 'Great job Joey!!, I love all your photos from India :).. I know I couldnt get myself to take photos of people I dont know LOL :P', '2007-03-13 12:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3456772, 477021, 54431, '<td valign="top">This shot is absolutely amazing! It''s truly magical and I hope that some day I can do some traveling and learn how to take a shot as beautiful as that. I will visit Iceland one day! I love all the stars in the sky, especially the shooting ones and the colors are brilliant. Great job and Congratulations on a well deserved blue ribbon!</td>', 'This shot is absolutely amazing! It''s truly magical and I hope that some day I can do some traveling and learn how to take a shot as beautiful as that. I will visit Iceland one day! I love all the stars in the sky, especially the shooting ones and the colors are brilliant. Great job and Congratulations on a well deserved blue ribbon!', '2007-03-13 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3457050, 477202, 49652, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  This is a terrific photo!</td>', 'Congrats!  This is a terrific photo!', '2007-03-13 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3457398, 471544, 66597, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this, but find it really underrated. The movement in the flag makes the statue appear to be in motion - like the guys really are on Iwo Jima raising the flag. Very cool.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this, but find it really underrated. The movement in the flag makes the statue appear to be in motion - like the guys really are on Iwo Jima raising the flag. Very cool.', '2007-03-13 20:23:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3457608, 471853, 63495, '<td valign="top">very nice keeps me looking for the one who made the tracks</td>', 'very nice keeps me looking for the one who made the tracks', '2007-03-13 21:57:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3457620, 472969, 63495, '<td valign="top">very cute shot dont know why this didnt score higher</td>', 'very cute shot dont know why this didnt score higher', '2007-03-13 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3457799, 474856, 326, '<td valign="top">WOW!! How AWESOME is that!!! Just Wonderful!!</td>', 'WOW!! How AWESOME is that!!! Just Wonderful!!', '2007-03-13 22:56:01.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3458573, 469377, 21807, '<td valign="top">Not one to post a comment, but I''d like to say how amazing this photograph is to me.  I thought, at first that it was posed... unreal.  It''s what we live for though huh?  Those incredibly profound moments that become a part of who we are.  That you would share this is appreciated.  Aloha</td>', 'Not one to post a comment, but I''d like to say how amazing this photograph is to me.  I thought, at first that it was posed... unreal.  It''s what we live for though huh?  Those incredibly profound moments that become a part of who we are.  That you would share this is appreciated.  Aloha', '2007-03-14 03:14:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458670, 477202, 53542, '<td valign="top">Its just like visualizing wonderland. Just magnificent. A piece of art</td>', 'Its just like visualizing wonderland. Just magnificent. A piece of art', '2007-03-14 04:20:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459018, 468429, 47906, '<td valign="top">First, I love the feling of the snow falling in this photo. It gives a very subtle feel to the photo. I have looked at this on 3 monitors now, 1 of which was uncalibrated, which gave you some processing rings to the photo that are not there on a calibrated monitor. On the laptop monitor,(lower video resolution) the sky was more washed out. On my calibrated monitor, the overall photo is evenly light, maybe a bit bright in the sky. YOu could try to tone it down a bit with the burn tool. <br/> <br/>I like the compostion, and the diagonal created with the platform in the water. I would however take a small crop off the bottm and a very slight one on the right hand side to force the platform and the dingy on to the lower right 3rd. <br/> <br/>Overall I think this is a really nice photo, taken down by really nice photos in the free study and possibly people who are picky of their skys. <br/> <br/>Hope this helps.<br/>Rich</td>', 'First, I love the feling of the snow falling in this photo. It gives a very subtle feel to the photo. I have looked at this on 3 monitors now, 1 of which was uncalibrated, which gave you some processing rings to the photo that are not there on a calibrated monitor. On the laptop monitor,(lower video resolution) the sky was more washed out. On my calibrated monitor, the overall photo is evenly light, maybe a bit bright in the sky. YOu could try to tone it down a bit with the burn tool.  I like the compostion, and the diagonal created with the platform in the water. I would however take a small crop off the bottm and a very slight one on the right hand side to force the platform and the dingy on to the lower right 3rd.  Overall I think this is a really nice photo, taken down by really nice photos in the free study and possibly people who are picky of their skys.  Hope this helps.Rich', '2007-03-14 06:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459262, 476273, 67043, '<td valign="top">Is dis sewar drainage ditch? I see garbage in water..</td>', 'Is dis sewar drainage ditch? I see garbage in water..', '2007-03-14 08:15:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459294, 474125, 58728, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic picture.  It was one of my 9''s.  The lighting is fabulous...it really tells the mood of the photo.</td>', 'This is a fantastic picture.  It was one of my 9''s.  The lighting is fabulous...it really tells the mood of the photo.', '2007-03-14 08:22:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459316, 471841, 58728, '<td valign="top">Absolutley beautiful. I love it.</td>', 'Absolutley beautiful. I love it.', '2007-03-14 08:27:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459351, 469837, 60899, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on the Jelly fish in the front...</td>', 'I like the focus on the Jelly fish in the front...', '2007-03-14 08:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459549, 477021, 14497, '<td valign="top">Spectacular photograph!  Congrats!</td>', 'Spectacular photograph!  Congrats!', '2007-03-14 09:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3459830, 477202, 50164, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju með borðann, Finnst þessi meira segja betri en sú sem vann.<br/>Frábært hjá þér á allan hátt.</td>', 'Til hamingju með borðann, Finnst þessi meira segja betri en sú sem vann.Frábært hjá þér á allan hátt.', '2007-03-14 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3460009, 477021, 74678, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry about "to many stars".  It adds to the mystical feeling of the cold and snow surround.  You did a fantastic job of capturing the moment, and should be proud.</td>', 'Don''t worry about "to many stars".  It adds to the mystical feeling of the cold and snow surround.  You did a fantastic job of capturing the moment, and should be proud.', '2007-03-14 11:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3460472, 477002, 1031, '<td valign="top">Maybe there''s "too much" going on here, with the viewer''s attention divided between the rock, ice, and snow. It''s a little hard to get "oriented" since different elements seem to slant in different directions, which may cause the viewer to feel uncomfortable or off-balance.</td>', 'Maybe there''s "too much" going on here, with the viewer''s attention divided between the rock, ice, and snow. It''s a little hard to get "oriented" since different elements seem to slant in different directions, which may cause the viewer to feel uncomfortable or off-balance.', '2007-03-14 12:13:11.000000', NULL, 0),
