(3466353, 475941, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective.  I thought my 10-22 was enough, but not anymore--this makes me want to buy a fisheye!  Into my favorites!<br/> <br/>One suggestion: I think it would have been good to clonme out the vapor trails.  They are the bane of my existence while shooting landscapes!</td>', 'Wonderful perspective.  I thought my 10-22 was enough, but not anymore--this makes me want to buy a fisheye!  Into my favorites! One suggestion: I think it would have been good to clonme out the vapor trails.  They are the bane of my existence while shooting landscapes!', '2007-03-16 11:15:03.000000', NULL, 0),
