(3590067, 476658, 11518, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Greetmir:</b></div><hr/><i> Just to add ... you couldn''t get this shot again if you parked your butt there for 10 years probably ... that alone makes it pretty damn special ... but the exposure is perfect too on top of it all! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I concur!  This is a once in a lifetime shot!</td>', 'Originally posted by Greetmir: Just to add ... you couldn''t get this shot again if you parked your butt there for 10 years probably ... that alone makes it pretty damn special ... but the exposure is perfect too on top of it all!   I concur!  This is a once in a lifetime shot!', '2007-04-28 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3590559, 472191, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the processing on this shot.</td>', 'I love the processing on this shot.', '2007-04-28 16:24:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3592495, 474716, 63269, '<td valign="top">I can''t BELIEVE that this only scored a 5.7!!! UHGG! These voters are the most unpredictable bunch I''ve ever seen. When I first saw this image, and faved it, I just presumed it was one of the really well liked ones that had gotten in the top ten or whatever. If you ask me, it looks exactly the type of thing that gets ribbons here. I thought the voters liked this kind of stuff... but nooo. Well, enough ranting. :) This is so lovely and haunting. It reminds me of an epic film or something. Your composition is glorious, the colors, tones, and the mist splendid. Fabulous shot. Worthy of at least a 7.5! :)</td>', 'I can''t BELIEVE that this only scored a 5.7!!! UHGG! These voters are the most unpredictable bunch I''ve ever seen. When I first saw this image, and faved it, I just presumed it was one of the really well liked ones that had gotten in the top ten or whatever. If you ask me, it looks exactly the type of thing that gets ribbons here. I thought the voters liked this kind of stuff... but nooo. Well, enough ranting. :) This is so lovely and haunting. It reminds me of an epic film or something. Your composition is glorious, the colors, tones, and the mist splendid. Fabulous shot. Worthy of at least a 7.5! :)', '2007-04-29 15:47:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(3593103, 477202, 61961, '<td valign="top">Two months later and still getting comments!  Congratulations on your ribbon and on your special photograph.<br/> <br/>Not my business, but I don''t think Jmnuggy meant to accuse anyone of cheating, he was just asking the question.  Thanks (Amason) for your explanation.<br/> <br/>I love all the comments in Icelandic! (íslenska) :-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Two months later and still getting comments!  Congratulations on your ribbon and on your special photograph. Not my business, but I don''t think Jmnuggy meant to accuse anyone of cheating, he was just asking the question.  Thanks (Amason) for your explanation. I love all the comments in Icelandic! (íslenska) :-) ', '2007-04-29 21:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
