(3615537, 469763, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is a good study of form and color. Though when going with such abstracts in ideas, it is best to go simplistic. In this case the netting and some of the lower weeds/plants distract from the image. Everything else is great though, lines, repeating patterns, and focus.</td>', 'This is a good study of form and color. Though when going with such abstracts in ideas, it is best to go simplistic. In this case the netting and some of the lower weeds/plants distract from the image. Everything else is great though, lines, repeating patterns, and focus.', '2007-05-04 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
